ub.com/users/bkincz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bkincz/clutch/commits/90b395806847fb5e645fb4a76b315c0e54b98842/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T02:31:54Z","email":"beni.kinczel@gmail.com","name":"Beni K"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T02:31:54Z","email":"beni.kinczel@gmail.com","name":"Beni K"},"message":"feat: Introduce `sharedMachine` for micro-frontends\n\nAdd `sharedMachine(key, factory, options?)` to enable multiple, independently\ndeployed apps on the same page to share a single machine instance.\n\nThis feature is designed for micro-frontend architectures, allowing state\nto be shared across separate bundles that co-exist on a single page.\n\n- Leverages a `globalThis` registry to ensure a machine is created once\n  per page per key, returning the same instance to all callers.\n- Introduces runtime warnings for situations where different app bundles\n  use conflicting Clutch versions or declare different contract versions\n  for the same shared machine.\n- Updates ESLint configuration to target ES2020 for improved syntax support.\n- Bumps package version to 3.1.0 and adds extensive documentation.","tree":{"sha":"7a6d181b50b0ec6105478910e376b9be7601067a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bkincz/clutch/git/trees/7a6d181b50b0ec6105478910e376b9be7601067a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bkincz/clutch/git/commits/90b395806847fb5e645fb4a76b315c0e54b98842","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9403180?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkincz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkincz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkincz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkincz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkincz","id":9403180,"lo