rred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PSPTorchinim/micros/commits/2df796686eff1987ab2f8f8467800f79561797e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T12:27:00Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Copilot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T12:27:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Always seed content types on startup to auto-seed newly added blocks (#549)\n\n* Initial plan\n\n* Auto-seed new Strapi blocks on every startup\n\nWhen a new block is added to Strapi, seed-content-types now runs on\nevery bootstrap so the new block is automatically seeded with example\ndata. Articles and pages remain first-run-only since they are large and\nalready idempotent on first run. Added run-bootstrap.test.ts (11 tests)\ndocumenting the new strategy.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/PSPTorchinim/micros/sessions/53c7f6bf-43dc-4108-90ca-275167b3bdfd\n\nCo-authored-by: PSPTorchinim <47593054+PSPTorchinim@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Potential fix for code scanning alert no. 277: Comparison between inconvertible types\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <62310815+github-advanced-security[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: PSPTorchinim <47593054+PSPTorchinim@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <62310815+github-advanced-security[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"691968ae9497bdae558af159aeb98f178c4b6ae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PSPTorchinim/micros/git/trees/691968ae9497bdae558af159aeb98f178c4b6ae8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PSPTorchinim/micros/git/commits/2df796686eff1987ab2f8f8467800f79561797e6","verification":{"payload":"tree 691