5819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/9b6e6c9b56b2aa787220cf4947be9428c115b09c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:44:49Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:44:49Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"message":"Render audio and tables on the blog, and the drone caveat on the player\n\nThree changes, all prompted by publishing the sonification findings post.\n\nThe blog renders markdown through react-markdown with remark-gfm and no rehype-raw, so an\n<audio> tag in a post is silently stripped. Rather than enable raw HTML, a link whose href ends\nin an audio extension now renders as a player with its link text as the caption. That matters\nbecause most posts on this blog are generated from external circular text, and turning on raw\nHTML would make any markup arriving through that pipeline executable. RSS readers, which render\nno components, still get an ordinary working link.\n\nTables had no styling at all, because the findings post is the first of 104 to use one. They\nrendered with zero cell padding, so a wide cell collided with its neighbour: \"near-identical\ndata, different palettes+0.607 to +0.814+0.476 to +0.639\". Colours are rgba rather than hex so\nthe design ratchet stays clean.\n\nThe player now renders the mapping key''s new drone caveat, which says the drone''s arc across a\ntrack reflects the scan path as much as the target. Optional in the type, so tracks published\nbefore today render exactly as they did.","tree":{"sha":"1694da73696ab6ae7465899449092b91a0fdbac9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/trees/1694da73696ab6ae7465899449092b91a0fdbac9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/commits/9b6e6c9b56b2aa787220cf4947be9428c115b09c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/9b6e6c9b56b2aa787220cf4947be9428c115b09c","node_id":"C_kwDOPd3yuNoAKDliNmU2YzliNTZiMmFhNzg3MjI