rl":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/f2bb03f0d2689d690357ebf53ccbfc6508d7d9f4","node_id":"C_kwDOPd3yuNoAKGYyYmIwM2YwZDI2ODlkNjkwMzU3ZWJmNTNjY2JmYzY1MDhkN2Q5ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/f839903a7486e5ca0b65d4325f3b0f23addc4b52","sha":"f839903a7486e5ca0b65d4325f3b0f23addc4b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/f839903a7486e5ca0b65d4325f3b0f23addc4b52"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/7c0c44af991e3d1f84f718602b87a9db322254b4","sha":"7c0c44af991e3d1f84f718602b87a9db322254b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/7c0c44af991e3d1f84f718602b87a9db322254b4"}],"sha":"f2bb03f0d2689d690357ebf53ccbfc6508d7d9f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/f2bb03f0d2689d690357ebf53ccbfc6508d7d9f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/7c0c44af991e3d1f84f718602b87a9db322254b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T10:14:45Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T10:14:45Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"message":"Put a sign-in control in the player''s header\n\nThe player hides the shell nav because it is a full-screen instrument with its own header,\nwhich also meant it was the one page on the site with no way to reach an account. Someone\nlanding on a shared track link had to navigate away to find a sign-in button.\n\nThe metadata and the new control share a single HeaderRight wrapper rather than each claiming\n`margin-left: auto`. Two siblings both claiming it split the free space between them and strand\nthe metadata mid-header instead of at the right edge.\n\nClerk''s avatar keeps its own size. Overriding it means selecting `.cl-avatarBox`, and Clerk\nwarns in the console that such selectors depend on its internal DOM and break on component\nupdates; HeaderAuth reserves the row height instead, so the header does not jump when the\npill is swapped for the avatar on load. `afterSignOutUrl` is likewise left to ClerkProvider,\nwhich already sets it to the site root: passing it to UserButton type-errors in Clerk v6.\n\nThis adds the button only. Liking and commenting need their own storage decision and are\ndeliberately not started here.","tree":{"