tarithm/Starithm-Home/commit/f839903a7486e5ca0b65d4325f3b0f23addc4b52","node_id":"C_kwDOPd3yuNoAKGY4Mzk5MDNhNzQ4NmU1Y2EwYjY1ZDQzMjVmM2IwZjIzYWRkYzRiNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/19f400dbd3479203874d34eabf667f73c07e74c7","sha":"19f400dbd3479203874d34eabf667f73c07e74c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/19f400dbd3479203874d34eabf667f73c07e74c7"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/a3c751b74be5b44cf22b6cf813854cb70821c5a1","sha":"a3c751b74be5b44cf22b6cf813854cb70821c5a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/a3c751b74be5b44cf22b6cf813854cb70821c5a1"}],"sha":"f839903a7486e5ca0b65d4325f3b0f23addc4b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/f839903a7486e5ca0b65d4325f3b0f23addc4b52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/a3c751b74be5b44cf22b6cf813854cb70821c5a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T11:26:42Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T11:26:42Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"message":"Ears: publish the legend, and stop implying the instruments mean something\n\nThe page credited instruments as \"chosen by an AI model from the measured\ndata\", which invites the reading that timbre encodes something about the\nobject. It does not, and since the arranger now varies palettes on purpose,\na listener comparing two tracks would have been misled by design.\n\nAdds a \"How to read this track\" panel under the transport, rendered from the\ntrack''s own published mapping rather than written into the page, so it stays\ntrue when a threshold or a scale changes. It names the four channels that do\ncarry information (pitch, loudness, time, voices) with the numbers needed to\ndecode them, and then says plainly that instruments, key and reverb carry\nnone, and that per-track loudness normalisation means absolute brightness\ncannot be recovered by ear.\n\nA button plays the track''s reference tone, its lowest and highest notes, so\nthe wavelength-to-pitch frame can be checked by ear.\n\nEverything is gated on the mapping block existing, so tracks published\nbefore it render exactly as they did, without the panel and without a button\nthat would fetch a file that is not there. Verified against a live track.","tree":{"sha":"2afd6802a6bd7f56b95f354f2bbc3762dddeefa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/trees/2afd6802a6bd7f56b95f354f2bbc3762dddeefa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/commits/a3c751b74be5b44cf22b6cf813854cb70821c5a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/fol