f236ba63b2cafbeda4cf3b67355"}],"sha":"19f400dbd3479203874d34eabf667f73c07e74c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/19f400dbd3479203874d34eabf667f73c07e74c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/129e77c52ab13f236ba63b2cafbeda4cf3b67355/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:24:12Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:24:12Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"message":"Ears: a real share card, not the vision model''s input image\n\nThe melody card was pointing at story.png, which is not artwork. It is the\nimage the storyteller vision model reads: a matplotlib figure on a white\nground with an axis frame, scatter dots and a \"song time (s)\" colorbar. In a\nfeed it reads as debug output. Being 700x700 it also forced twitter:card\ndown to `summary`, since a square under summary_large_image gets\ncentre-cropped to 1.91:1 and loses its top and bottom.\n\nAdds public/og/ears-share.png, in the same family as the site card: dark\nground, purple bloom behind the arc mark, Newsreader headline with the\nitalic line in purple, and a low thin spectrogram strip along the bottom\nedge as the one cue that this page is sound. 1200x630 is exactly the 1.91:1\nLinkedIn and X want, so nothing is cropped. twitter:card goes back to\nsummary_large_image.\n\nGeneric rather than per-track on purpose: it covers every track ever\npublished, including the older ones that predate map.png, with no backfill.\nA track that publishes `urls.card_image` supersedes it with no code change,\nso going per-track later costs nothing now. The raw material for that would\nbe map.png (clean, no axes), not story.png.\n\nThe render source lives in tools/og-cards/ with the command that produced\nit, so the card can be edited later instead of being an opaque PNG.\n\nVerified both paths: the generic card asserts 1200x630, a faked\nurls.card_image is used verbatim and omits the dimensions, since its shape\nwould not be known. 9/9 tracks across the oldest and newest days still\nrender valid cards and JSON-LD with no duplicate tags.","tree":{"sha":"0a2b4a9a4ff6379e601731024f940c24eecc5c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/trees/0a2b4a9a4ff6379e601731024f940c24eecc5c7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/commits/129e77c52ab13f236ba63b2cafbeda4cf3b67355","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/129e77c52ab13f236ba63b2cafbeda4cf3b67355","node_id":"C_kwDOPd3yuNoAKDEyOWU3N2M1MmFiMTNmMjM2YmE2M2IyY2FmYmVkYTRjZjNiNjczNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/1803415af0fecc6e11f408ff24176718bfcfaaec","sha":"1803415af0fecc6e11f408ff24176718bfcfaaec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/1803415af0fecc6e11f408ff24176718bfcfaaec"}],"sha":"129e77c52ab13f236ba63b2cafbeda4cf3b67355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/129e77c52ab13f236ba63b2cafbeda4cf3b67355"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/sub