hor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/c1cf3b8246cdde44666e4544c94238bd029522fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:50:51Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:50:51Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"message":"Ears: share a melody as the melody, not as the generic site card\n\n/ears-to-the-universe had no prerendering of any kind, so every shared\ntrack link showed the site-wide Starithm card with no hint of which\nmelody was behind it.\n\nDone at request time rather than at build time: tracks are published\ndaily by the sky-melodies pipeline, so a card baked at deploy would\ndescribe yesterday''s music. The function resolves the track from the\nsame R2 JSON the player reads, and handles all three URL shapes —\nbare (latest day, first track), /:date, and /:date/:trackId.\n\n  og:title  The Shifting Heart · Mrk-1066\n  og:desc   A journey through a galaxy''s breath, where light sings and\n            silence grows. Seyfert 2 Galaxy. Made audible from JWST\n            observations.\n  og:image  .../tracks/2026-09-13/jw07802-.../story.png\n\nstory.png is 700x700, so this asks for the square `summary` card. Under\nsummary_large_image most unfurlers centre-crop a square to 1.91:1 and\ncut the top and bottom off the artwork. A wide card needs sky-melodies\nto publish a 1200x630 image per track.\n\nAlso injects the poem chapters and science note as crawler-readable\nbody text, MusicRecording JSON-LD, and og:audio for the m4a.\n\ndate and trackId are regex-constrained before being interpolated into\nan R2 URL. Humans get the untouched SPA shell and never pay for the R2\nround trip, same as api/event-page.ts.\n\nRan the handler against live R2 over the oldest and newest days:\n9/9 tracks produced valid cards and valid JSON-LD, no duplicate tags,\nno undefined leakage. Bad dates, unknown track ids and a path-traversal\nattempt all fall back cleanly.","tree":{"sha":"9068b3157d2877547d5fd7fe6ca89002f9ba307f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/trees/9068b3157d2877547d5fd7fe6ca89002f9ba307f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/commits/c1cf3b8246cdde44666e4544c94238bd029522fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/c1cf3b8246cdde44666e4544c94238bd029522fc","node_id":"C_kwDOPd3yuNoAKGMxY2YzYjgyNDZjZGRlNDQ2NjZlNDU0NGM5NDIzOGJkMDI5NTIyZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commit/3aace186395188347f84561d304d206aee50ca3e","sha":"3aace186395188347f84561d304d206aee50ca3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/3aace186395188347f84561d304d206aee50ca3e"}],"sha":"c1cf3b8246cdde44666e4544c94238bd029522fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/c1cf3b8246cdde44666e4544c94238bd029522fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/3aace186395188347f84561d304d206aee50ca3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:50:39Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:50:39Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"message":"Blog: stop shipping duplicate og: tags and a stale twitter: card\n\nThe prerenderer injected its tags after <head> but left the shell''s own\nsite-wide tags in place further down, so every post carried two og:title,\ntwo og:description and two name=\"description\" values. Unfurlers disagree\non whether the first or the last wins, so the card was a coin flip.\n\ntwitter:* was never overridden at all. X reads those in preference to\nog:*, so all 101 posts shared as \"Starithm - Real-time Astronomical\nEvent Intelligence Platform\" regardless of which post was linked.\n\n  - strip og:/twitter:/article:/description/title/author, <title> and\n    canonical from the shell before injecting\n  - emit the full twitter:* set, og:image, og:site_name and article:*\n  - cut excerpts on a word boundary at 200 chars; the hard 160-char\n    slice ended cards mid-word (\"...with a sh\")\n  - card title drops the \"| Starithm Blog\" suffix, which unfurlers\n    already render from og:site_name; <title> keeps it\n  - optional `image:` frontmatter for a per-post card, falling back to\n    the site card (dimensions are only asserted for the site card,\n    whose shape we know)\n\nVerified over a full run: 0 of 101 posts have a duplicate tag.","tree":{"sha":"7666ec6a574e1e791fe6bdfa5fb570d58c319fc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/trees/7666ec6a574e1e791fe6bdfa5fb570d58c319fc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/commits/3aace186395188347f84561d304d206aee50ca3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"h