tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/commits/704bbcde4ef9fdf885f414ffb49603a2afb9492e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:50:29Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:50:29Z","email":"kusha.mil@gmail.com","name":"kushasahu7"},"message":"Link previews: unfurlers were getting the empty React shell\n\nBOT_REGEX listed crawlers and AI retrieval agents but no chat-app link\nunfurlers beyond Facebook, Twitter, WhatsApp and Telegram, so pasting an\nevent link into Slack, Discord, Bluesky or Reddit produced the generic\nsite-wide card instead of the event''s own:\n\n  Slackbot-LinkExpanding  -> x-starithm-prerender: spa\n  Discordbot/2.0          -> spa\n  Bluesky Cardyb/1.1      -> spa\n  redditbot/1.0           -> spa\n  WhatsApp, Twitterbot    -> hit\n\nAdds those plus Mastodon/Pleroma/Misskey, Pinterest, Tumblr, Flipboard,\nEmbedly, Iframely, Skype, VK, Nuzzel, Snapchat, Viber, Yandex.\n\nThe list, the SPA fallback and the strip-then-inject rule now live in\napi/_shared/prerender.ts, because the blog build script and the melody\nfunction need exactly the same logic and a second copy would drift.\nVercel does not route directories under api/ that start with \"_\".","tree":{"sha":"5fd54bd8c984959436d66f270ae1c93d9ce3b8ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/trees/5fd54bd8c984959436d66f270ae1c93d9ce3b8ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/commits/704bbc