s\n\nPutting \"How it sounds\" in the aside column collapsed the poem to a\nhairline. That column is height-capped and the poem is its only shrinkable\nchild, both siblings being flex: none, so a third fixed block made the\npoem absorb the entire shortfall.\n\nThe block moves to its own component under the note ladder, where it reads\nbetter anyway: both describe the music itself, rather than the words and\nthe science.\n\nThe poem also gains a minimum height, so the next sibling added to that\ncolumn cannot squeeze it away again. It still scrolls.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea4390fcb973b45c00b3488fd9b9dee8940bca2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/trees/ea4390fcb973b45c00b3488fd9b9dee8940bca2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Starithm/Starithm-Home/git/commits/cdc1f6be7607ba99463c90e7e61331c465fc9593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13705819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kushasahu7","id":13705819,"login":"kushasahu7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzA1ODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushasahu7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http