ost applications.\n- Included examples for React Router, Next.js, and vanilla JavaScript integration.\n\nfeat: define routing utilities for staff management\n\n- Created StaffRoutes object for managing staff-related routes.\n- Implemented utility functions for breadcrumbs, staff ID parsing, and route checks.\n\nchore: configure Tailwind CSS and TypeScript\n\n- Set up Tailwind CSS configuration to extend base styles.\n- Created TypeScript configuration for the staff hub project.","tree":{"sha":"041b08578f84112081c487c9636322ea1b4512f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnidevIdp/fix-mfe/git/trees/041b08578f84112081c487c9636322ea1b4512f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnidevIdp/fix-mfe/git/commits/707715521a297681c677bf47f2cae3d5f99145ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/UnidevIdp/fix-mfe/commit/707715521a297681c677bf47f2cae3d5f99145ca","node_id":"C_kwDOPeagDtoAKDcwNzcxNTUyMWEyOTc2ODFjNjc3YmY0N2YyY2FlM2Q1Zjk5MTQ1Y2E","parents":[],"sha":"707715521a297681c677bf47f2cae3d5f99145ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnidevIdp/fix-mfe/commits/707715521a297681c677bf47f2cae3d5f99145ca"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnidevIdp/fix-mfe/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=029f16c8a20addebef69695b962b5617e7d394dc&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A41%3A13.584Z"}');
