ptimization)\n- Update GitHub Actions workflow to use optimized deployment folder\n- Add --legacy-peer-deps flag to npm ci commands\n- Create clean deployment directory with only essential files\n- Remove all source maps and unnecessary files before deployment\n- Add build:prod script for optimized production builds\n\nThis fixes the Azure SWA deployment size limit error (250MB limit on free tier)\nby reducing the deployment size significantly.\n\nOptimizations applied:\n- sourceMap: false (removes .map files)\n- vendorChunk: false (reduces number of files)\n- buildOptimizer: true (better tree shaking)\n- Deployment folder only includes built assets, not source code\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bca4fa8d0459ff9eeb6a637c18b1fd646402b3ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amoolagundla/angular-single-spa/git/trees/bca4fa8d0459ff9eeb6a637c18b1fd646402b3ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amoolagundla/angular-single-spa/git/commits/e1a7d9aa478a2fea2567a3df2f79da46b044e865","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3297279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amoolagundla","id":3297279,"login":"amoolagundla","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTcyNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription