oolagundla/angular-single-spa/commits/adb5251b4d4e747a11edb58d499f770b02d15174/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-18T16:57:02Z","email":"am8215@gmail.com","name":"abhinav moolagundla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-18T16:57:02Z","email":"am8215@gmail.com","name":"abhinav moolagundla"},"message":"feat: Implement tab-based microfrontend architecture\n\n- Added tab-based loading of Angular and React microfrontends on same page\n- Created standalone Angular app that loads React MFE as parcels in tabs\n- Added Claude Code workflows for design review and documentation\n- Configured SystemJS and Single-SPA for dynamic module loading\n- Created multiple build configurations (single-spa, standalone, tabs-only)\n- Added CLAUDE.md with project documentation and design principles\n- Fixed Angular 19 compatibility issues with TypeScript version\n- Created simple HTML demo (tabs-only.html) for easy testing\n\nThe application now supports:\n- Angular content in one tab\n- React MFE dynamically loaded in another tab\n- Both frameworks running simultaneously in split view\n- No routing required - everything works through tabs\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d17e6cde030291df56b87a44e1b198c5d80e08e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amoolagundla/angular-single-spa/git/trees/4d17e6cde030291df56b87a44e1b198c5d80e08e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amoolagundla/angular-single-spa/git/commits/adb5251b4d4e747a11edb58d499f770b02d15174","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3297279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolagundla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoolag