tterns for common use cases (email, phone, URL)\n  * Form accessibility helpers for ARIA attributes\n\n- Update demo app to showcase latest capabilities:\n  * Add Form Molecules Showcase section with live examples\n  * Update test count from 322 to 424 tests passing\n  * Add form molecules badge and updated hero section\n  * Include interactive examples with validation and state management\n\n- Add comprehensive test coverage:\n  * 102 new tests for form molecules (424 total tests passing)\n  * Full TypeScript type safety and IntelliSense support\n  * WCAG AA compliance with proper ARIA attributes\n\n- Add documentation:\n  * Complete form molecules integration guide\n  * API documentation with usage examples\n  * Accessibility guidelines and best practices\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: None - all additions are backward compatible\n\nCloses: Form molecules implementation and demo showcase integration","tree":{"sha":"04d1a95bcbd7f0cdf5daecd36f5ca1cac512b000","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell/git/trees/04d1a95bcbd7f0cdf5daecd36f5ca1cac512b000"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell/git/commits/528ead6f9a695b2c12d7e0c028545004ed6ebb47","verification":{"payload":"tree 04d1a95bcbd7f0cdf5daecd36f5ca1cac512b000\nparent 581d455e8f1a1335656a1c09cc75e58316624e72\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756057844 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756057854 -0600\n\nfeat: add comprehensive form molecules ecosystem with demo showcase\n\n- Add 8 new form molecule components with full accessibility support:\n  * FormField: Universal wrapper with label, description, and error handling\n  * SearchBox: Debounced search with clear functionality and loading states\n  * Select: HeadlessUI-powered dropdown with search and multi-select capabilities\n  * Checkbox: Accessible checkbox with indeterminate state support\n  * Radio: HeadlessUI RadioGroup with full accessibility features\n  * Textarea: Auto-resizing textarea with comprehensive functionality\n  * FileUpload: Drag-and-drop upload with preview and validation\n  * SwitchField: Enhanced switch wrapper with form field functionality\n\n- Add comprehensive form utilities:\n  * useFormField hook for consistent state management\n  * validateField function with built-in validation rules\n  * validationPatterns for common use cases (email, phone, URL)\n  * Form accessibility helpers for ARIA attributes\n\n- Update demo app to showcase latest capabilities:\n  * Add Form Molecules Showcase section with live examples\n  * Update test count from 322 to 424 tests passing\n  * Add form molecules badge and updated hero section\n  * Include interactive examples with validation and state management\n\n- Add comprehensive test coverage:\n  * 102 new tests for form molecules (424 total tests passing)\n  * Full TypeScript type safety and IntelliSense support\n  * WCAG AA compliance with proper ARIA attributes\n\n- Add documentation:\n  * Complete form molecules integration guide\n  * API documentation with usage examples\n  * Accessibility guidelines and best practices\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: None - all additions are backward compatible\n\nCloses: Form molecules implementation and demo showcase integration\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKtQ/gAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npM5dAPsGR0L4BcwxxOZRYtwN6YKtnU5QXUwkEun6kKCCHjw0fQEAy7vJ77aXST60\n3hfFl5RZxetgplxs/trnFMZ3a8Obsgk=\n=Rfr0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-24T17:51:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4975788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum","id":4975788,"login":"