events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum","id":4975788,"login":"jonmatum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NzU3ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell/commits/ddf7c4f45ec839c40839187424c93391eee9ad32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-24T05:03:26Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T05:03:42Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"message":"feat: add CSS export for MFE component styling\n\n🎨 **CSS Export Solution**\n- Add comprehensive styles.css with design token variables\n- Export CSS file through package.json for easy import\n- Include light/dark theme CSS variables\n- Add semantic color utilities (text-text-primary, bg-surface-primary, etc.)\n- Provide smooth transitions and accessibility focus styles\n\n📦 **Package Updates**\n- Update package.json exports to include ./styles path\n- Modify build script to copy CSS to dist folder\n- Ensure CSS is available for consuming applications\n\n🎯 **Design Token System**\n- Complete color palette (primary, success, warning, danger, error)\n- Theme-aware semantic colors with CSS custom properties\n- Light/dark mode support with proper contrast ratios\n- Accessibility-compliant focus indicators\n\n🚀 **Usage**\nConsuming apps can now import:\nimport ''@jonmatum/react-mfe-shell/styles''\n\nThis resolves styling issues in demo applications and provides\na reliable way to ensure MFE components render correctly.","tree":{"sha":"6443cdeebcf298f5ac2b81c6e9d838f6a6142ff7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell/git/trees/6443cdeebcf298f5ac2b81c6e9d838f6a6142ff7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell/git/commits/ddf7c4f45ec839c40839187424c93391eee9ad32","verification":{"payload":"tree 6443cdeebcf298f5ac2b81c6e9d838f6a6142ff7\nparent 45bbb6c5b16d92210cd330a0ee4d9ada88eb87f6\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756011806 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756011822 -0600\n\nfeat: add CSS export for MFE component styling\n\n🎨 **CSS Export Solution**\n- Add comprehensive styles.css with design token variables\n- Export CSS file through package.json for easy import\n- Include light/dark theme CSS variables\n- Add semantic color utilities (text-text-primary, bg-surface-primary, etc.)\n- Provide smooth transitions and accessibility focus styles\n\n📦 **Package Updates**\n- Update package.json exports to include ./styles path\n- Modify build script to copy CSS to dist folder\n- Ensure CSS is available for consuming applications\n\n🎯 **Design Token System**\n- Complete color palette (primary, success, warning, danger, error)\n- Theme-aware semantic colors with CSS custom properties\n- Light/dark mode support with proper contrast ratios\n- Accessibility-compliant focus indicators\n\n🚀 **Usage**\nConsuming apps can now import:\nimport ''@jonmatum/react-mfe-shell/styles''\n\nThis resolves styling issues in demo applications and provides\na reliable way to ensure MFE components render correctly.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKqdLgAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npIEXAP9RRhrZ+Md8cwqKmD2kvM7cxVur0nrr64LWlwBqv2KDsgEAiA2i1