:22Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T01:52:22Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"message":"feat: perfect mobile space distribution with centered gap between status and controls\n\n- Change from gap-4 to justify-between for optimal space distribution:\n  - Eliminates blank space on the right side of controls\n  - Centers the gap between status display and score controls\n  - Provides balanced visual layout on all screen sizes\n- Optimize mobile layout alignment:\n  - Status section (icon, badge, score) aligned to left\n  - Score controls (selector) aligned to right edge\n  - Space distributed evenly in the middle\n  - No wasted space or awkward gaps\n- Maintain responsive behavior and functionality:\n  - Hidden ''Update Score:'' text on mobile saves space\n  - Overflow protection prevents layout breaks\n  - Flexible status section adapts to content\n  - Fixed controls maintain proper size and position\n- Improve visual balance across all devices:\n  - Mobile: Compact layout with centered space distribution\n  - Tablet: Proper spacing with visible labels\n  - Desktop: Optimal layout with full clarity\n- Update README to document perfect space distribution strategy\n\nThe control section now provides optimal space usage with perfectly centered gaps and no wasted space on any device size.","tree":{"sha":"c882e547712d7ceb16cc9ff5e8421d9318e01c20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/trees/c882e547712d7ceb16cc9ff5e8421d9318e01c20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/commits/f164bcc734a7f80332bf89a373223564b81bd003","verification":{"payload":"tree c882e547712d7ceb16cc9ff5e8421d9318e01c20\nparent 5f3597a00dc7e4fdd8d1cf514dec6697b27de80b\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756259542 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756259542 -0600\n\nfeat: perfect mobile space distribution with centered gap be