eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/commits/91e9efd9e9fbcbf3e1aa1fe007176fcbeadf8b77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-27T01:42:06Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T01:42:06Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"message":"fix: implement proper overflow handling for both vertical and horizontal scrolling\n\n- Change from overflow-y-auto to overflow-auto for bidirectional scrolling:\n  - Handles both vertical and horizontal content overflow\n  - Ensures scrollbars appear when content exceeds container dimensions\n  - Provides complete content accessibility in all directions\n- Add min-w-0 constraints to prevent grid overflow issues:\n  - Apply to main grid container and all grid items\n  - Prevents content from expanding beyond available space\n  - Ensures proper grid behavior with long content\n- Implement proper text wrapping with break-words:\n  - Add break-words to all text content for proper wrapping\n  - Prevents long words from causing horizontal overflow\n  - Maintains readability while ensuring content fits\n- Add flex-shrink-0 to icons to prevent compression:\n  - Ensures icons maintain proper size and appearance\n  - Prevents layout issues when content is constrained\n- Update README to document complete overflow handling approach\n\nThe modal now properly handles all content overflow scenarios with visible scrollbars and proper text wrapping, ensuring no content is ever hidden or inaccessible.","tree":{"sha":"fd3a69e6b49b5ce72d38b8064d0a2177a934733e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/trees/fd3a69e6b49b5ce72d38b8064d0a2177a934733e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/commits/91e9efd9e9fbcbf3e1aa1fe007176fcbeadf8b77","verification":{"payload":"tree fd3a69e6b49b5ce72d38b8064d0a2177a934733e\nparent c6026e8e8e153581b41ca4cad3bc943b7df1db00\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756258926 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756258926 -0600\n\nfix: implement proper overflow handling for both vertical and horizontal scrolling\n\n- Change from overflow-y-auto to overflow-auto for bidirectional scrolling:\n  - Handles both vertical and horizontal content overflow\n  - Ensures scrollbars appear when content exceeds container dimensions\n  - Provides complete content accessibility in all directions\n- Add min-w-0 constraints to prevent grid overflow issues:\n  - Apply to main grid container and all grid items\n  - Prevents content from expanding beyond available space\n  - Ensures proper grid behavior with long content\n- Implement proper text wrapping with break-words:\n  - Add break-words to all text content for proper wrapping\n  - Prevents long words from causing horizontal overflow\n  - Maintains readability while ensuring content fits\n- Add flex-shrink-0 to icons to prevent compression:\n  - Ensures icons maintain proper size and appearance\n  - Prevents layout issues when content is constrained\n- Update README to document complete overflow handling approach\n\nThe modal now properly handles all content overflow scenarios with visible scrollbars and proper text wrapping, ensuring no content is ever hidden or inaccessible.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaK5ibgAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npHAPAQDwzf3aro8SKjRNmtCpDuD3zI4FYuq1wsgd4f1jb73SkAEAqKBmaGQK107D\nGaG2pUWXsLyPTmZRBGciIYYSVHkYUgA=\n=jDwE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":