educed footer complexity eliminates distraction\n- Professional branding establishes trust and recognition\n- Consistent visual language throughout application\n- Better focus on core functionality\n\n📊 **Technical Improvements**\n- Custom SVG favicon for crisp display at all sizes\n- Proper Badge component usage showcasing default variant\n- Cleaner HTML structure with updated favicon reference\n- Optimized CSS with simplified footer classes\n- Better component organization and imports\n\nThis enhancement establishes strong TaskMaster Pro brand identity while\nmaintaining clean attribution to React MFE Shell technology, creating\na professional application appearance that users can trust and recognize.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKswcwAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npHyFAQD6Rp+HYov+eedNEoUp1fWDGQxkVUq37LPmOI/Hmm3MIgD/ep2+k+Zz9uI4\nVR8O7nxPsISZrNYkUi7mPJDqIWry/w0=\n=MlVk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-24T15:32:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4975788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum","id":4975788,"login":"jonmatum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NzU3ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://