":"2025-08-24T15:24:09Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"message":"fix: clean modal UX with single close button and full-width actions\n\n🎨 **Modal UX Cleanup & Improvement**\n- Removed redundant custom close buttons from both modals\n- Leveraged Modal component''s built-in close functionality (ESC key, backdrop click)\n- Eliminated confusing dual close button pattern for cleaner UX\n\n🔘 **Full-Width Button Layout**\n- Task Details Modal: Implemented full-width status change buttons stacked vertically\n- Create Task Modal: Used full-width primary and secondary action buttons\n- Enhanced button hierarchy with clear visual priority (Create Task > Cancel)\n- Improved mobile experience with touch-friendly full-width targets\n\n📱 **Enhanced Mobile Experience**\n- Full-width buttons provide better touch targets on mobile devices\n- Vertical button stacking prevents cramped horizontal layouts\n- Clear visual hierarchy with primary action prominence\n- Consistent spacing and padding across all screen sizes\n\n🎯 **Task Details Modal Improvements**\n- Status change buttons now use descriptive labels: \"Mark as To Do\", \"Mark as In Progress\", \"Mark as Completed\"\n- Added checkmark (✓) indicator for current status\n- Full-width buttons with proper disabled states\n- Clean footer section with clear \"Change Status\" label\n\n📝 **Create Task Modal Improvements**\n- Removed redundant close button in favor of Modal''s built-in functionality\n- Added descriptive subtitle: \"Fill in the details below to create a new task\"\n- Primary action (Create Task) positioned prominently at top\n- Secondary action (Cancel) positioned below with secondary styling\n- Enhanced loading state: \"Creating Task...\" with proper loading spinner\n\n🔧 **Technical Improvements**\n- Removed unused XIcon component and import\n- Added comprehensive disabled states during form submission\n- Enhanced form validation with proper loading state management\n- Updated safelist with new spacing classes (space-y-3, space-y-2)\n- Improved TypeScript imports cleanup\n\n🎨 **Visual Design Enhancements**\n- Consistent border and background styling across modal sections\n- Proper visual separation between header, body, and footer\n- Enhanced spacing with space-y-6 for body content and space-y-3 for footer actions\n- Professional color usage with surface-secondary backgrounds\n\nThis cleanup creates a much cleaner, more professional modal experience that\nfollows modern UX patterns while leveraging the full capabilities of the\nReact MFE Shell Modal component.","tree":{"sha":"5314f17a369e2f47272b743921c022e093c554af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/trees/5314f17a369e2f47272b743921c022e093c554af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/commits/6187afd10c4e5b94704ee5910d1ce273a1916fa8","verification":{"payload":"tree 5314f17a369e2f47272b743921c022e093c554af\nparent ea62198aaa0066332cd54c7db0a905f939bf5fae\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756049049 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756049049 -0600\n\nfix: clean modal UX with single close button and full-width actions\n\n🎨 **Modal UX Cleanup & Improvement**\n- Removed redundant custom close buttons from both modals\n- Leveraged Modal component''s built-in close functionality (ESC key, backdrop click)\n- Eliminated confusing dual close button pattern for cleaner UX\n\n🔘 **Full-Width Button Layout**\n- Task Details Modal: Implemented full-width status change buttons stacked vertically\n- Create Task Modal: Used full-width primary and secondary action buttons\n- Enhanced button hierarchy with clear visual priority (Create Task > Cancel)\n- Improved mobile experience with touch-friendly full-width targets\n\n📱 **Enhanced Mobile Experience**\n- Full-width buttons provide better touch targets on mobile devices\n- Vertical button stacking prevents cramped horizontal layouts\n- Clear visual hierarchy with primary action promin