outs\n- Improved form validation and loading states in Create Task modal\n\n🎯 **Enhanced User Experience**\n- Task Details Modal:\n  * Professional header with title, badges, and close button\n  * Organized content sections with background highlights\n  * Enhanced assignee display with larger avatars and role information\n  * Improved date formatting with weekday and full date display\n  * Dedicated footer with status action buttons\n- Create Task Modal:\n  * Structured form layout with proper spacing and organization\n  * Enhanced input validation and loading state management\n  * Improved tag management with removable badges\n  * Professional footer with action buttons\n\n📊 **Badge Variant Usage Patterns**\n- Status badges: success (completed), warning (in-progress), secondary (todo), default (fallback)\n- Priority badges: danger (high), warning (medium), success (low), default (fallback)\n- Tag badges: primary for task tags, default for removable form tags\n- Special badges: danger with dot prop for overdue indicators\n\n🔍 **Safelist Enhancements**\n- Added all badge variant classes to ensure production build coverage\n- Included modal-specific layout classes (max-w-xl, max-w-2xl, border-b, border-t)\n- Added responsive grid classes (grid-cols-1, md:grid-cols-2)\n- Ensured complete coverage for enhanced spacing and layout classes\n\nThis enhancement transforms the modal experience from basic functionality to\nprofessional, enterprise-ready user interfaces while showcasing the complete\ncapabilities of the React MFE Shell badge component system.","tree":{"sha":"c21e01d7c4839b855ffbf2667602aa4a44464793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/trees/c21e01d7c4839b855ffbf2667602aa4a44464793"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/commits/ea62198aaa0066332cd54c7db0a905f939bf5fae","verification":{"payload":"tree c21e01d7c4839b855ffbf2667602aa4a44464793\nparent c9729308f7be52cd2abaf36b5b3baa0713bf90c2\nauthor