 Usage Patterns**\n- Status badges: success (completed), warning (in-progress), secondary (todo), default (fallback)\n- Priority badges: danger (high), warning (medium), success (low), default (fallback)\n- Tag badges: primary for task tags, default for removable form tags\n- Special badges: danger with dot prop for overdue indicators\n\n🔍 **Safelist Enhancements**\n- Added all badge variant classes to ensure production build coverage\n- Included modal-specific layout classes (max-w-xl, max-w-2xl, border-b, border-t)\n- Added responsive grid classes (grid-cols-1, md:grid-cols-2)\n- Ensured complete coverage for enhanced spacing and layout classes\n\nThis enhancement transforms the modal experience from basic functionality to\nprofessional, enterprise-ready user interfaces while showcasing the complete\ncapabilities of the React MFE Shell badge component system.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKstbQAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npMaYAQDmNTSUyq1FN/i8RDrZv77FKkGYycSZGBe1HI8OrMr38gD+NZlE3PrYMQ75\nDN6czw+B0ikQXAeb1Vad68R4DUSOQAY=\n=O9gh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-24T15:19:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4975788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum","id":4975788,"login":"jonmatum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NzU3ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":