ading states with proper feedback\n- Consistent component sizing and spacing\n\n🔍 **Technical Benefits**\n- Reduced custom CSS by using component props\n- Better accessibility with proper label integration\n- Cleaner JSX structure without wrapper divs\n- Type-safe prop usage with full TypeScript support\n- Optimal bundle size by leveraging built-in functionality\n\nThis enhancement showcases the complete power of React MFE Shell components,\ndemonstrating how proper prop usage creates professional, accessible, and\nmaintainable user interfaces without custom styling or complex workarounds.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKssMwAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npK4GAQDjzo3H1cMLpElKF0oaiH6eIAa6fLiB0KoaIEkGV1Q5cwD/b0io7CUPg1jv\nsrvpcizhjSyJ0P/7f0y0/MYDlbe8nAw=\n=sNiB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-24T15:14:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4975788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum","id":4975788,"login":"jonmatum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NzU3ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/commit/c9729308f7be52cd2abaf36b5b3baa0713bf90c2","node_id":"C_kwDOPerowNoAK