 Responsive Design: Stacked on mobile, side-by-side on desktop\n- Theme Integration: Adapts to light/dark mode automatically\n\n🎨 **Visual Design**\n- Clean, professional layout with proper spacing\n- Interactive hover states for all clickable elements\n- Consistent with application design system\n- Proper visual hierarchy with typography variants\n- Subtle borders and background colors for definition\n\n📱 **Responsive Layout**\n- Mobile: Stacked layout with centered alignment\n- Desktop: Horizontal layout with space-between distribution\n- Proper spacing and typography scaling\n- Touch-friendly targets for mobile interaction\n\n🔧 **Technical Implementation**\n- Added footer-specific classes to Tailwind safelist\n- Semantic HTML structure with proper accessibility\n- External links with security attributes (noopener, noreferrer)\n- Smooth transitions and hover effects\n- Integration with existing MFE components (Text, Badge, Divider)\n\nThis footer provides proper attribution to the React MFE Shell package while\nmaintaining professional appearance and offering helpful navigation to users\ninterested in the underlying technology.","tree":{"sha":"faff81b0463dc8ffe784d32e176540f538302f04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/trees/faff81b0463dc8ffe784d32e176540f538302f04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/commits/79c61e0326decb5fd6ada8d36d0d9379c6f365dc","verification":{"payload":"tree faff81b0463dc8ffe784d32e176540f538302f04\nparent 11d50d4c8519bbd5e72ec50c9fc5cd7f570fea81\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756047899 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756047899 -0600\n\nfeat: add professional footer with React MFE Shell attribution and version display\n\n🎯 **Professional Footer Implementation**\n- Added comprehensive footer showcasing React MFE Shell package\n- Prominent version badge displaying v6.2.0 for transparency\n- Direct links to npm package, GitHub repo, and docume