daptation\n- Proper TypeScript interfaces for icon components\n- Consistent sizing with className prop support\n- Better accessibility with semantic SVG paths\n- Reduced bundle size by removing emoji font dependencies\n\n📊 **Build Verification**\n- Production build successful: 252.66 KB JS (78.67 KB gzipped)\n- CSS bundle: 35.83 KB with comprehensive class coverage\n- All MFE components render correctly with proper styling\n- No console errors or missing class warnings\n\nThis ensures professional appearance and complete styling coverage for all application states and interactions.","tree":{"sha":"19310b788da884022876a10533984abddb70ca88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/trees/19310b788da884022876a10533984abddb70ca88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/commits/11d50d4c8519bbd5e72ec50c9fc5cd7f570fea81","verification":{"payload":"tree 19310b788da884022876a10533984abddb70ca88\nparent 635dae0e5bfeba78ece0746133b51773944f3de5\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756047459 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756047459 -0600\n\nrefactor: remove all emojis and replace with professional SVG icons + comprehensive safelist audit\n\n🎨 **Professional Icon System Implementation**\n- Replaced all emoji icons with custom SVG components for professional appearance\n- Created semantic icon components: TasksIcon, ClockIcon, CheckIcon, FireIcon, PlusIcon, XIcon\n- Consistent styling with proper className props and currentColor support\n- Scalable vector graphics ensure crisp rendering at all sizes\n\n📋 **Emoji Removal Audit**\n- Removed emojis from application code (📋⏳✅🔥+✕)\n- Cleaned up README.md and QA-REPORT.md documentation\n- Maintained professional appearance throughout application\n- No functional changes, only visual improvements\n\n🔧 **Comprehensive Safelist Audit & Enhancement**\n- Added 100+ missing Tailwind classes to safelist based on actual usage analysis\n- Included all TaskMaster Pro specific classes:\n  * Layout: grid-cols-*, flex-*, items-*, justify-*\n  * Spacing: space-*, gap-*, margin/padding variants\n  * Typography: text-*, font-* variants\n  * Colors: bg-*, text-*, border-* with all semantic variants\n  * Interactive: hover:*, focus:*, transition-*\n  * Responsive: sm:*, md:*, lg:* breakpoint classes\n- Ensured complete CSS generation for production builds\n\n🎯 **Technical Improvements**\n- SVG icons use currentColor for automatic theme adaptation\n- Proper TypeScript interfaces for icon components\n- Consistent sizing with className prop support\n- Better accessibility with semantic SVG paths\n- Reduced bundle size by removing emoji font dependencies\n\n📊 **Build Verification**\n- Production build successful: 252.66 KB JS (78.67 KB gzipped)\n- CSS bundle: 35.83 KB with comprehensive class coverage\n- All MFE components render correctly with proper styling\n- No console errors or missing class warnings\n\nThis ensures professional appearance and complete styling coverage for all application states and interactions.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKsoYwAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npLmAAQC46UgGhsxyhZl50ysotIgOaMp1OISLy5zKhG3p0m95bgD/baOkEP1JhkUR\ncViHnphnsmyCdxjg0tknmv8xK6U5AgE=\n=C0q5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-24T14:57:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4975788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum","id":4975788,"login":"jonmatum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NzU3ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmat