ommits/635dae0e5bfeba78ece0746133b51773944f3de5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-24T14:51:33Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T14:51:50Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"message":"feat: transform demo into TaskMaster Pro - real-world task management application\n\n🚀 **Complete Application Transformation**\n- Converted simple component showcase into comprehensive task management app\n- Built production-ready application demonstrating real-world MFE usage\n- Showcases all React MFE Shell components in practical scenarios\n\n📋 **TaskMaster Pro Features**\n- Task CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete)\n- Status management (Todo, In Progress, Completed)\n- Priority system (High, Medium, Low) with visual indicators\n- Team assignment with user avatars and roles\n- Due date tracking with overdue indicators\n- Tag system for task categorization\n- Real-time search and filtering\n- Interactive dashboard with statistics\n\n🎨 **UI/UX Implementation**\n- Professional dashboard layout with header navigation\n- Statistics cards showing project metrics\n- Task cards with comprehensive information display\n- Modal workflows for task creation and details\n- Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)\n- Light/dark theme switching with persistence\n- Loading states and smooth animations\n\n🧩 **MFE Component Showcase**\n- SettingsProvider: Global state management\n- Button: Multiple variants, sizes, and interactive states\n- Input: Form validation, search, and data entry\n- Badge: Status indicators, priorities, and removable tags\n- Avatar: User profiles with fallback initials\n- Switch: Theme toggle and settings controls\n- Modal: Task creation and detail overlays\n- Card: Layout containers and information display\n- LoadingSpinner: Application loading states\n- Text: Typography with semantic styling\n\n🏗 **Technical Architecture**\n- TypeScript: Full type safety with complex interfaces\n- State Management: React hooks with complex application state\n- Component Composition: Reusable patterns and prop drilling\n- Event Handling: User interactions and form submissions\n- Data Modeling: Task, User, and application entities\n- Performance: Optimized rendering and state updates\n\n📊 **Real-World Use Cases**\n- Software development team task tracking\n- Marketing campaign management\n- Product launch coordination\n- Client project management\n- Cross-functional team collaboration\n\n🎯 **Production Readiness**\n- Error handling and validation\n- Accessibility compliance (WCAG AA)\n- Mobile-first responsive design\n- Performance optimization\n- SEO metadata and social sharing\n- Professional branding and styling\n\nThis transformation demonstrates how React MFE Shell enables rapid development\nof complex, production-ready applications with consistent design and behavior.","tree":{"sha":"9951a706706c63e4438558fb26b715d3118e59c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/trees/9951a706706c63e4438558fb26b715d3118e59c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/commits/635dae0e5bfeba78ece0746133b51773944f3de5","verification":{"payload":"tree 9951a706706c63e4438558fb26b715d3118e59c3\nparent 93049abcf0030005c89f31b4beae12390a6544a8\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756047093 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756047110 -0600\n\nfeat: transform demo into TaskMaster Pro - real-world task management application\n\n🚀 **Complete Application Transformation**\n- Converted simple component showcase into comprehensive task management app\n- Built production-ready application demonstrating real-world MFE usage\n- Showcases all React MFE Shell components in practical scenarios\n\n📋 **TaskMaster Pro Features**\n- Task CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete)\n- Status management (Todo, In Progress, Completed)\n- Priority system (High, Medium, Low) with visual indicators\n- Team assignment with user avatars and roles\n- Due date tracking with overdue indicators\n- Tag system for task categorization\n- Real-time search and filtering\n- Interactive dashboard with statistics\n\n🎨 **UI/UX Implementation**\n- Professional dashboard layout with header navigation\n- Statistics cards showing project metrics\n- Task cards with comprehensive information display\n- Modal workflows for task creation and details\n- Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)\n- Light/dark theme switching with persistence\n- Loading states and smooth animations\n\n🧩 **MFE Component Showcase**\n- SettingsProvider: Global state management\n- Button: Multiple variants, sizes, and interactive states\n- Input: Form validation, search, and data entry\n- Badge: Status indicators, priorities, and removable tags\n- Avatar: User profiles with fallback initials\n- Switch: Theme toggle and settings controls\n- Modal: Task creation and detail overlays\n- Card: Layout containers and information display\n- LoadingSpinner: Application loading states\n- Text: Typography with semantic styling\n\n🏗 **Technical Architecture**\n- TypeScript: Full type safety with complex interfaces\n- State Management: React hooks with complex application state\n- Component Composition: Reusable patterns and prop drilling\n- Event Handling: User interactions and form submissions\n- Data Modeling: Task, User, and application entities\n- Performance: Optimized rendering and state updates\n\n📊 **Real-World Use Cases**\n- Software development team task tracking\n- Marketing campaign management\n- Product launch coordination\n- Client project management\n- Cross-functional team collaboration\n\n🎯 **Production Readiness**\n- Error handling and validation\n- Accessibility compliance (WCAG AA)\n- Mobile-first responsive design\n- Performance optimization\n- SEO metadata and social sharing\n- Professional branding and styling\n\nThis transformation demonstrates how React MFE Shell enables rapid development\nof complex, production-ready applications with consistent design and behavior.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKsnBgAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npElAAQDMwTd99A/uv9Kk+BF5rS56UhiufCtKAZLT90qDMsn1hwD/XfIHCNffZd34\n2u2OW1ekO1uA05nax6XiIG26ceDXUgk=\n=Km87\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-24T14:51:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4975788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum","id":4975788,"login":"jonmatum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NzU3ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/commit/635dae0e5bfeba78ece0746133b51773944f3de5","node_id":"C_kwDOPerowNoAKDYzNWRhZTBlNWJmZWJhNzhlY2UwNzQ2MTMzYjUxNzczOTQ0ZjNkZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/commit/93049abcf0030005c89f31b4beae12390a6544a8","sha":"93049abcf0030005c89f31b4beae12390a6544a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/commits/93049abcf0030005c89f31b4beae12390a6544a8"}],"sha":"635dae0e5bfeba78ece0746133b51773944f3de5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/commits/635dae0e5bfeba78ece0746133b51773944f3de5"},{"author"