email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T05:20:51Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"message":"fix: resolve styling issues by matching Tailwind CSS version with MFE package\n\n🔧 **Root Cause Identified & Fixed**\n- Demo app was using Tailwind CSS v4.1.12 (incompatible configuration)\n- MFE package uses Tailwind CSS v3.4.17 (different config syntax)\n- Safelist configuration wasn''t working due to version mismatch\n\n🎯 **Solution Implemented**\n- Downgraded demo app to Tailwind CSS v3.4.17 to match MFE package\n- Updated PostCSS configuration for Tailwind v3 compatibility\n- Copied exact Tailwind configuration from MFE package\n- Added comprehensive safelist with ALL MFE component classes\n\n📊 **Results**\n- CSS bundle increased from 9.97 KB to 35.15 KB (comprehensive coverage)\n- All MFE-specific classes now generated:\n  ✅ bg-success-600, bg-warning-600, bg-danger-600\n  ✅ text-success-700, text-warning-700, text-error-700\n  ✅ hover:bg-success-700, hover:bg-warning-700\n  ✅ Dark mode variants (dark:bg-success-500, etc.)\n  ✅ Focus states, borders, and all component variants\n\n🚀 **Technical Details**\n- Tailwind v3.4.17: Compatible with MFE package design tokens\n- Safelist: 200+ classes ensuring all MFE components render correctly\n- PostCSS: Standard configuration with autoprefixer\n- Build: Successful with comprehensive CSS generation\n\nDemo app styling should now be fully functional and match the MFE package demo!","tree":{"sha":"d6cfc78aff0fffb0dba329ff91655b3eaadb205b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/trees/d6cfc78aff0fffb0dba329ff91655b3eaadb205b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/react-mfe-shell-demo/git/commits/27b79a026dea508c5a7943d58205b733405f0312","verification":{"payload":"tree d6cfc78aff0fffb0dba329ff91655b3eaadb205b\nparent 6922928fe6649bdcf2b289a579b41c21048142c8\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756012851 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1756012851 -0600\n\nfix: resolve styling issues by matching Tailwind CSS version with MFE package\n\n🔧 **Root Cause Identified & Fixed**\n- Demo app was using Tailwind CSS v4.1.12 (incompatible configuration)\n- MFE package uses Tailwind CSS v3.4.17 (different config syntax)\n- Safelist configuration wasn''t working due to version mismatch\n\n🎯 **Solution Implemented**\n- Downgraded demo app to Tailwind CSS v3.4.17 to match MFE package\n- Updated PostCSS configuration for Tailwind v3 compatibility\n- Copied exact Tailwind configuration from MFE package\n- Added comprehensive safelist with ALL MFE component classes\n\n📊 **Results**\n- CSS bundle increased from 9.97 KB to 35.15 KB (comprehensive coverage)\n- All MFE-specific classes now generated:\n  ✅ bg-success-600, bg-warning-600, bg-danger-600\n  ✅ text-success-700, text-warning-700, text-error-700\n  ✅ hover:bg-success-700, hover:bg-warning-700\n  ✅ Dark mode variants (dark:bg-success-500, etc.)\n  ✅ Focus states, borders, and all component variants\n\n🚀 **Technical Details**\n- Tailwind v3.4.17: Compatible with MFE package design tokens\n- Safelist: 200+ classes ensuring all MFE components render correctly\n- PostCSS: Standard configuration with autoprefixer\n- Build: Successful with comprehensive CSS generation\n\nDemo app styling should now be fully functional and match the MFE package demo!\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKqhMwAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npJ/YAP0STFpc8x8bEvr2xNxV6Zke9TCcp1EX6y9hgvgYqrcsRgD/R8SB3Wee7D6N\nPNumbuSdaF38S08dlLyg130llUr8ygM=\n=hFqK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-24T05:21:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4975788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use