.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/97885c1289b21bd2f78745a0a02824ed5de2b5d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-29T00:34:20Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-29T00:34:20Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"我已經成功修改了 `src/tools/transcriber.py` 中的 `check_model` 函式，用一個高效的本地檔案檢查取代了原來緩慢的 API 呼叫。這解決了後端超時的根本原因。","tree":{"sha":"a99b0bd64cf4100e19aa26ae04eab32dea3c8a63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/a99b0bd64cf4100e19aa26ae04eab32dea3c8a63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/97885c1289b21bd2f78745a0a02824ed5de2b5d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/97885c1289b21bd2f78745a0a02824ed5de2b5d4","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDk3ODg1YzEyODliMjFiZDJmNzg3NDVhMGEwMjgyNGVkNWRlMmI1ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/37abbc5652dd8786c7a9d9345d96574796942e5c","sha":"37abbc5652dd8786c7a9d9345d96574796942e5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/37abbc5652dd8786c7a9d9345d96574796942e5c"}],"sha":"97885c1289b21bd2f78745a0a02824ed5de2b5d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/97885c1289b21bd2f78745a0a02824ed5de2b5d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/37abbc5652dd8786c7a9d9345d96574796942e5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-28T23:54:51Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T23:54:51Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(fullstack): 解決 opencc 依賴並移除失效的功能旗標\n\n本次提交修復了兩個問題：\n1.  一個 `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named ''opencc''` 的後端錯誤。\n2.  一個導致「下載模型」按鈕被禁用的前端邏輯錯誤。\n\n首先，透過 `apt-get install -y opencc` 安裝了缺失的系統級函式庫，解決了 `opencc-python-reimplemented` 套件的安裝問題。\n\n其次，發現 `TaskUploader.vue` 元件被一個失效的功能旗標 `<fieldset>` 包裹，該旗標會呼叫一個已棄用的 API，導致整個元件被永久禁用。透過移除這個 `<fieldset>`，恢復了 UI 的互動性。\n\n最後，擴充了 Playwright 測試 (`full_launch.spec.js`)，以驗證「下載模型」按鈕現在能夠被正確渲染和點擊，確保問題已從根本上解決。","tree":{"sha":"5425159cd5f298b7532439b1ef314701dd9bd312","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/5425159cd5f298b7532439b1ef314701dd9bd312"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/37abbc5652dd8786c7a9d9345d96574796942e5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/37abbc5652dd8786c7a9d9345d96574796942e5c","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDM3YWJiYzU2NTJkZDg3ODZjN2E5ZDkzNDVkOTY1NzQ3OTY5NDJlNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/b2deca6c2286751eab71751d15438dad2fe10f05","sha":"b2deca6c2286751eab71751d15438dad2fe10f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/b2deca6c2286751eab71751d15438dad2fe10f05"}],"sha":"37abbc5652dd8786c7a9d9345d96574796942e5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/37abbc5652dd8786c7a9d9345d96574796942e5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/b2deca6c2286751eab71751d15438dad2fe10f05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-28T20:59:54Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T20:59:54Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(fullstack): 實作工作者狀態的完整通訊鏈\n\n為背景工作者建立一套完整的通訊管線，使其能將狀態回報給前端。\n\n此變更解決了 UI 會錯誤地將服務顯示為「未啟動」的問題，即使該服務已在背景正常運行。\n\n具體變更如下：\n- `workers/transcription_worker.py`: 工作者現在會在啟動時發送一個 POST 請求，宣告其已「準備就緒」。\n- `src/api_server.py`: 新增了一個內部端點 (`/api/internal/worker_status`) 來接收工作者的狀態更新。\n- `src/api_server.py`: 新的端點會透過 WebSocket 廣播一個 `SERVICE_STATUS_UPDATE` 訊息給所有客戶端。\n- `vue-app/src/stores/tasks.js`: 前端狀態管理器現在會處理 `SERVICE_STATUS_UPDATE` 訊息並更新應用程式狀態，從而讓 UI 能反映工作者的真實狀態。","tree":{"sha":"3483bf74dfc9b495867c9cf645fefcbd467167b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/3483bf74dfc9b495867c9cf645fefcbd467167b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/b2deca6c2286751eab71751d15438dad2fe10f05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/b2deca6c2286751eab71751d15438dad2fe10f05","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGIyZGVjYTZjMjI4Njc1MWVhYjcxNzUxZDE1NDM4ZGFkMmZlMTBmMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/07a4f3853eb467f953ee4c26e2040843f6517362","sha":"07a4f3853eb467f953ee4c26e2040843f6517362","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/07a4f3853eb467f953ee4c26e2040843f6517362"}],"sha":"b2deca6c2286751eab71751d15438dad2fe10f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/b2deca6c2286751eab71751d15438dad2fe10f05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/07a4f3853eb467f953ee4c26e2040843f6517362/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-28T20:56:19Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T20:56:19Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(fullstack): Implement status communication chain for worker\n\nImplements the full communication pipeline for backend workers to report their status to the frontend.\n\nThis addresses an issue where the UI would incorrectly show services as \"Not Started\" even when they were running correctly in the background.\n\nThe following changes were made:\n- `workers/transcription_worker.py`: The worker now sends a POST request on startup to announce it is \"ready\".\n- `src/api_server.py`: A new internal endpoint (`/api/internal/worker_status`) was added to receive worker status updates.\n- `src/api_server.py`: The new endpoint now broadcasts a `SERVICE_STATUS_UPDATE` message via WebSockets to all clients.\n- `vue-app/src/stores/tasks.js`: The frontend store now handles the `SERVICE_STATUS_UPDATE` message and updates the application state accordingly, allowing the UI to reflect the worker''s true status.","tree":{"sha":"4c38447ee5458d18284d2efdc7d5aca54e1e0bcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/4c38447ee5458d18284d2efdc7d5aca54e1e0bcb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/07a4f3853eb467f953ee4c26e2040843f6517362","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avata