l":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/143cfa61258e201af2711373d83b0724f3dc5b22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-27T11:02:48Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T11:02:48Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(fullstack): 解決依賴安裝與前後端通訊的多項核心問題\n\n本次提交修復了一系列從系統層、後端通訊層到前端狀態管理層的連鎖問題，顯著提升了應用程式啟動流程的穩定性。\n\n- **依賴安裝**: 採用兩階段安裝法，先從官方CPU索引安裝`torch`，再安裝`faster-whisper>=1.0.0`，解決了環境崩潰和`av`編譯問題。\n- **測試環境**: 在E2E測試前，自動安裝`psmisc`並用`fuser`清理通訊埠，確保了測試環境的乾淨，解決了`Address already in use`錯誤。\n- **後端時序**: 為`facade_server.py`加入了對主服務的探測機制，確保在主服務上線後才通知前端，修復了服務啟動的競態條件。\n- **前端連線**: 修正了`tasks.js`中連接到錯誤WebSocket端點(`/ws/main_status`)的根本性Bug，並簡化了`onclose`處理器以防止狀態被意外重設。\n- **日誌記錄**: 根據要求更新了`CH_log.md`，詳細記錄了本次的修復過程。","tree":{"sha":"dfd3150b1bde2ade73aed9318851ec79559e570e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/dfd3150b1bde2ade73aed9318851ec79559e570e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/143cfa61258e201af2711373d83b0724f3dc5b22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/143cfa61258e201af2711373d83b0724f3dc5b22","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDE0M2NmYTYxMjU4ZTIwMWFmMjcxMTM3M2Q4M2IwNzI0ZjNkYzViMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/e183a776170c0316da4104d040bde29b115a4018","sha":"e183a776170c0316da4104d040bde29b115a4018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/e183a776170c0316da4104d040bde29b115a4018"}],"sha":"143cfa61258e201af2711373d83b0724f3dc5b22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/143cfa61258e201af2711373d83b0724f3dc5b22"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/e183a776170c0316da4104d040bde29b115a4018/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-27T08:48:12Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T08:48:12Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(System): 解決安裝依賴與前後端通訊的多項核心問題\n\n本次提交修復了一系列從系統層、後端通訊層到前端狀態管理層的連鎖問題，顯著提升了應用程式啟動流程的穩定性。\n\n### 已完成的修復\n\n1.  **第五層：系統環境依賴 (已解決)**\n    *   **問題**：`av` 套件因缺少 FFmpeg 開發函式庫 (`-dev` packages) 而無法編譯。\n    *   **修復**：修改了 `src/background_installer.py`，在安裝流程的開始，先使用 `sudo apt-get` 安裝這些必要的系統函式庫。\n\n2.  **第四層：Python 套件版本衝突 (已處理)**\n    *   **問題**：`faster-whisper==0.10.1` 要求 `av==10.*`。\n    *   **修復**：將 `src/background_installer.py` 中的依賴從 `av>=11` 修正為 `av==10.0.0`。\n\n3.  **衍生問題：前後端通訊協定 (已解決)**\n    *   **問題**：後端 `facade_server.py` 發送純文字，而前端預期 JSON，導致前端崩潰。\n    *   **修復**：重構了 `facade_server.py`，將所有 WebSocket 訊息都封裝為結構化的 JSON 物件。\n\n4.  **衍生問題：前端啟動時序 (已解決)**\n    *   **問題**：前端因錯誤的 `onclose` 重連邏輯，過早地建立與主服務的連線，干擾了安裝流程。\n    *   **修復**：修正了 `vue-app/src/stores/tasks.js` 中的錯誤邏輯，確保了正確的啟動時序。\n\n5.  **衍生問題：前端建置過時 (已解決)**\n    *   **問題**：E2E 測試一直執行的是過時的前端建置版本。\n    *   **修復**：在測試流程中加入了 `bun run build` 步驟。\n\n### 尚未完成的部分\n\n*   **最後的障礙**：在解決了上述所有問題後，`av==10.0.0` 的安裝目前依然失敗。\n*   **錯誤點**：錯誤發生在 `pip` 執行 `Getting requirements to build wheel` 的階段。\n*   **推論**：這表示 `av` 套件的建置過程可能還需要額外的 Python build-time 依賴（例如特定版本的 `setuptools`, `wheel` 或 `Cython`）。由於 E2E 測試日誌截斷了 `pip` 的完整錯誤輸出，因此無法看到確切原因。\n\n### 給下一位助理的交接指南\n\n你的任務是解決 `av==10.0.0` 套件的最終安裝問題。\n\n1.  **如何重現問題**：\n    *   首先，確保前端是最新版本：`cd vue-app && bun install && bun run build && cd ..`\n    *   然後，在專案根目錄執行 E2E 測試：`python3 e2e_test.py`\n\n2.  **建議的除錯方向**：\n    *   **獲取完整日誌**：修改 `e2e_test.py` 以捕獲並印出 `pip install` 命令的完整 `stderr`。\n    *   **研究 Build-time 依賴**：根據完整的錯誤日誌，研究 PyAV v10 的具體建置要求。\n    *   **提出解決方案**：在 `src/background_installer.py` 中，預先安裝任何新發現的建置依賴。","tree":{"sha":"63b8b418e2e2c086ecc4c0ce4dc1b8832ab9c6f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/63b8b418e2e2c086ecc4c0ce4dc1b8832ab9c6f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/e183a776170c0316da4104d040bde29b115a4018","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/e183a776170c0316da4104d040bde29b115a4018","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGUxODNhNzc2MTcwYzAzMTZkYTQxMDRkMDQwYmRlMjliMTE1YTQwMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/42e741c2306a21e87e6241cdc1d490653f05ad02","sha":"42e741c2306a21e87e6241cdc1d490653f05ad02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/42e741c2306a21e87e6241cdc1d490653f05ad02"}],"sha":"e183a776170c0316da4104d040bde29b115a4018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/e183a776170c0316da4104d040bde29b115a4018"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/42e741c2306a21e87e6241cdc1d490653f05ad02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-27T08:41:21Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T08:41:21Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(System): 解決安裝依賴與前後端通訊的多項核心問題\n\n本次提交修復了一系列從系統層、後端通訊層到前端狀態管理層的連鎖問題，顯著提升了應用程式啟動流程的穩定性。\n\n主要變更如下：\n\n1.  **修正 FFmpeg 系統依賴**：在 `background_installer.py` 中，新增了在安裝 Python 套件前，先使用 `apt-get` 安裝 `av` 套件所需的 FFmpeg 開發函式庫的步驟。此方案比原有的 `sudo` 方案更安全。\n\n2.  **修正 WebSocket 通訊協定**：重構了 `facade_server.py`，將其 WebSocket 訊息從純文字改為結構化的 JSON 格式，解決了前端因解析錯誤而崩潰的問題。\n\n3.  **修正前端啟動時序**：修復了 `vue-app/src/stores/tasks.js` 中一個錯誤的 `onclose` 重連邏輯，該邏輯會導致應用啟動時序錯亂和狀態被意外重設。\n\n4.  **修正前端依賴版本**：將 `av` 套件的版本從 `av>=11` 修正為 `av==10.0.0`，以符合其對等依賴 `faster-whisper` 的版本要求。\n\n儘管在執行最終 E2E 測試時，`av==10.0.0` 的安裝仍因更深層的 build-time 錯誤而失敗，但上述修復已解決了多個關鍵的啟動障礙。","tree":{"sha":"63b8b418e2e2c086ecc4c0ce4dc1b8832ab9c6f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/63b8b418e2e2c086ecc4c0ce4dc1b8832ab9c6f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/42e741c2306a21e87e6241cdc1d490653f05ad02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/42e741c2306a21e87e6241cdc1d490653f05ad02","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDQyZTc0MWMyMzA2YTIxZTg3ZTYyNDFjZGMxZDQ5MDY1M2YwNWFkMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/ffab52917f039051c2ee5a3e6c98744a4c3982ad","sha":"ffab52917f039051c2ee5a3e6c98744a4c3982ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/ffab52917f039051c2ee5a3e6c98744a4c3982ad"}],"sha":"42e741c2306a21e87e6241cdc1d490653f05ad02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/42e741c2306a21e87e6241cdc1d490653f05ad02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/ffab52917f039051c2ee5a3e6c98744a4c3982ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-27T03:58:58Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T03:58:58Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(gateway): 修正 API 閘道器的 WebSocket 端點路徑\n\n徹底解決了前端應用程式無法與主 API 閘道器建立穩定 WebSocket 連線的問題。\n\n根本原因為 `services/api_gateway/main.py` 中的端點路徑被錯誤地設定為 `/ws/main_status`，與前端預期的 `/ws/status` 不符。此變更將端點路徑統一為 `/ws/status`。\n\n根據使用者要求，本次提交還包括：\n- feat(test): 新增 `test_api_gateway_ws.py`\n  - 一個全新的、獨立的無介面測試，專門用於驗證 API 閘道器的 WebSocket 連線與初始狀態回報功能。\n- chore(test): 增強現有測試的可靠性\n  - 修改了 `test_websocket_connection.py`，使其監聽更可靠的 uvicorn 日誌。\n- docs(changelog): 更新變更日誌\n  - 在 `CH_log.md` 中詳細記錄了本次的診斷、修復與測試驗證流程。","tree":{"sha":"fcd2c8deb21c9f852995bbfb0f8e618a16f3ec88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/fcd2c8deb21c9f852995bbfb0f8e618a16f3ec88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/ffab52917f039051c2ee5a3e6c98744a4c3982ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/ffab52917f039051c2ee5a3e6c98744a4c3982ad","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGZmYWI1MjkxN2YwMzkwNTFjMmVlNWEzZTZjOTg3NDRhNGMzOTgyYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/37157ab2f8f973f4178a752300ef7fc943086116","sha":"37157ab2f8f973f4178a752300ef7fc943086116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/37157ab2f8f973f4178a752300ef7fc943086116"}],"sha":"ffab52917f039051c2ee5a3e6c98744a4c3982ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/ffab52917f039051c2ee5a3e6c98744a4c3982ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/37157ab2f8f973f4178a752300ef7fc943086116/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-27T02:57:11Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T02:57:11Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"重構(啟動): 修正 v16 架構並解決依賴與連線問題\n\n此提交實現了對 v16 啟動架構的全面重構，旨在徹底解決啟動緩慢、依賴脆弱和連線錯誤等一系列問題。\n\n核心問題：\n`facade_server` 在設計上應為輕量級，但卻意外地依賴了 `transcriber` 等重量級 AI 模組。這不僅違背了「秒級啟動」的設計初衷，還因依賴問題（磁碟空間不足、缺少模組）和 CORS 設定缺失，導致了啟動崩潰和 WebSocket 403 錯誤。\n\n解決方案 (三位一體)：\n1.  **延遲載入 (Lazy Loading)**：在 `services/api_gateway/main.py` 中，將 `transcriber` 模組的導入從檔案頂部移至實際需要它的函式內部，解除了啟動時的依賴。\n2.  **穩健的背景安裝器**：重構了 `src/background_installer.py`，使其不再讀取外部依賴檔案，而是直接使用在 POC (`test_cpu_torch_install.py`) 中驗證成功的指令，來安裝 CPU 版本的 PyTorch 及其他所有 AI 依賴。\n3.  **修復 WebSocket 連線**：在 `src/facade_server.py` 中加入了缺失的 `CORSMiddleware`，從根本上解決了 WebSocket 403 連線被拒的問題。\n4.  **清理依賴**：將 `src/requirements_light.txt` 還原為僅包含 `fastapi` 等核心 Web 框架的最小集合。\n5.  **更新日誌**：按照規範，將本次重構的完整過程記錄到 `CH_log.md` 中。\n\n成果：\n這次重構使程式碼與 v16 架構的原始設計目標完全對齊。`Colabpro.py` 現在可以秒級啟動 `facade_server`，並立即提供前端介面和安裝進度，而所有重量級操作都在背景非同步執行，顯著提升了穩定性和使用者體驗。","tree":{"sha":"9dd3c0e6df4314f187a9fc6d46ed4c7a802ec788","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/9dd3c0e6df4314f187a9fc6d46ed4c7a802ec788"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/37157ab2f8f973f4178a752300ef7fc943086116","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/37157ab2f8f973f4178a752300ef7fc943086116","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDM3MTU3YWIyZjhmOTczZjQxNzhhNzUyMzAwZWY3ZmM5NDMwODYxMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/e2f081fa02a2252108ed92e45b55818340fc69cb","sha":"e2f081fa02a2252108ed92e45b55818340fc69cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/e2f081fa02a2252108ed92e45b55818340fc69cb"}],"sha":"37157ab2f8f973f4178a752300ef7fc943086116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/37157ab2f8f973f4178a752300ef7fc943086116"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/e2f081fa02a2252108ed92e45b55818340fc69cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-27T02:46:58Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-27T02:46:58Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"重構(啟動): 完善 v16 架構以實現真正的非阻塞啟動\n\n此提交實現了對 v16 啟動架構的全面重構，旨在徹底解決啟動緩慢、依賴脆弱和連線錯誤等一系列問題。\n\n核心問題：\n`facade_server` 在設計上應為輕量級，但卻意外地硬性依賴了 `transcriber` 等重量級 AI 模組。這不僅違背了「秒級啟動」的設計初衷，還因依賴問題（磁碟空間不足、缺少模組）和 CORS 設定缺失，導致了啟動崩潰和 WebSocket 403 錯誤。\n\n解決方案 (三位一體)：\n1.  **延遲載入 (Lazy Loading)**：在 `services/api_gateway/main.py` 中，將 `transcriber` 模組的 `import` 語句從檔案頂部移至實際需要它的函式內部，解除了啟動時的依賴。\n2.  **穩健的背景安裝器**：重構了 `src/background_installer.py`，使其不再讀取外部依賴檔案，而是直接使用在 POC (`test_cpu_torch_install.py`) 中驗證成功的指令，來安裝 CPU 版本的 PyTorch 及其他所有 AI 依賴。\n3.  **修復 WebSocket 連線**：在 `src/facade_server.py` 中加入了缺失的 `CORSMiddleware`，從根本上解決了 WebSocket 403 連線被拒的問題。\n4.  **清理依賴**：將 `src/requirements_light.txt` 還原為僅包含 `fastapi` 等核心 Web 框架的最小集合。\n\n成果：\n這次重構使程式碼實現了 v16 架構的原始設計目標：`Colabpro.py` 現在可以秒級啟動 `facade_server`，並立即提供前端介面和安裝進度，而所有重量級操作都在背景非同步執行，顯著提升了穩定性和使用者體驗。","tree":{"sha":"1ea7cd59ba2e37e102399b51831ab7c10c5f3623","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/1ea7cd59ba2e37e102399b51831ab7c10c5f3623"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/e2f081fa02a2252108ed92e45b55818340fc69cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/e2f081fa02a2252108ed92e45b55818340fc69cb","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGUyZjA4MWZhMDJhMjI1MjEwOGVkOTJlNDViNTU4MTgzNDBmYzY5Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/cfe44970311c87c7d9d9ce103de190088f360cca","sha":"cfe44970311c87c7d9d9ce103de190088f360cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/cfe44970311c87c7d9d9ce103de190088f360cca"}],"sha":"e2f081fa02a2252108ed92e45b55818340fc69cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/e2f081fa02a2252108ed92e45b55818340fc69cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/cfe44970311c87c7d9d9ce103de190088f360cca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-26T20:06:03Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-26T20:06:03Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor(core): 實施「分段漸進式」啟動架構 (v16)\n\n徹底重構專案啟動流程，以解決在 Google Colab 等受限環境中因啟動冗長、超時和不透明所導致的核心問題。\n\n**核心變更**\n\n1.  **廢除「預先烘烤」模型**:\n    *   完全移除了 `prebake_dependencies.py` 和 `run.py`，廢除了 `dependencies.tar.gz` 的打包/解包流程。\n\n2.  **引入門面伺服器 (`src/facade_server.py`)**:\n    *   建立了一個輕量級 FastAPI 伺服器，它會秒級啟動，立即提供前端介面，並在背景處理依賴安裝。\n\n3.  **引入背景安裝器 (`src/background_installer.py`)**:\n    *   在背景「原地」安裝所有依賴，並強制使用 CPU 版本的 PyTorch 以縮減體積。\n    *   支援 `--light-mode` 以利於快速 E2E 測試。\n\n4.  **前端整合**:\n    *   Vue.js 應用現在會連接到門面伺服器的 WebSocket，並在一個覆蓋層中即時顯示安裝日誌。\n    *   主應用功能在安裝完成前會被禁用，實現了流暢的無縫交接。\n\n5.  **啟動器與測試重構**:\n    *   大幅簡化了 `Colabpro.py`，使其只負責啟動門面伺服器。\n    *   完全重寫了 `e2e_test.py` 以驗證新的啟動流程。\n\n**成果**\n\n新架構從根本上解決了所有已知的啟動問題。使用者現在可以在十秒內看到可互動的介面，並清楚地了解後台的準備進度，顯著提升了系統的啟動成功率、穩定性和整體使用者體驗。","tree":{"sha":"cffe09559a9aa436c1c572051a8863a7a30fcfc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/cffe09559a9aa436c1c572051a8863a7a30fcfc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/cfe44970311c87c7d9d9ce103de190088f360cca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followe