-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/53284ebe3a5e4af8b6aca862347d4e4bc0ee67f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-25T16:43:38Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-25T16:43:38Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"docs(chlog): 記錄並總結本次的架構重構與除錯歷程\n\n根據使用者要求，新增一份詳細的日誌，記錄從實現新的「監督者-工人」架構，到系統性地發現並修復一系列深層次 Bug 的完整過程。\n\n這份日誌總結了我們如何透過新的可觀測性架構，定位並解決了包括前端 Payload、後端 NameError、工人環境 (PYTHONPATH, API_PORT)、依賴缺失、非同步處理、日誌流向和測試腳本斷言等多個環環相扣的問題。\n\n這份紀錄將作為未來開發的重要參考。","tree":{"sha":"97bc4ea535c0bb22f962d780c910a40b52ab9730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/97bc4ea535c0bb22f962d780c910a40b52ab9730"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/53284ebe3a5e4af8b6aca862347d4e4bc0ee67f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/53284ebe3a5e4af8b6aca862347d4e4bc0ee67f1","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDUzMjg0ZWJlM2E1ZTRhZjhiNmFjYTg2MjM0N2Q0ZTRiYzBlZTY3ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c968d310d49f46bf4cccaff4f4fb506402cd8345","sha":"c968d310d49f46bf4cccaff4f4fb506402cd8345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c968d310d49f46bf4cccaff4f4fb506402cd8345"}],"sha":"53284ebe3a5e4af8b6aca862347d4e4bc0ee67f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/53284ebe3a5e4af8b6aca862347d4e4bc0ee67f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c968d310d49f46bf4cccaff4f4fb506402cd8345/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-25T16:33:06Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-25T16:33:06Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(core): 修復端對端任務處理流程並重構監督機制\n\n本次提交包含了一系列重大的架構重構與 Bug 修復，旨在徹底解決前後端任務處理流程中斷的問題。\n\n核心變更分為兩大部分：\n\n1. 架構重構 (Architecture Refactoring):\n根據使用者的診斷報告，我們實現了一套更健壯、可觀測的「監督者-工人」模式。\n- 擴充狀態機：任務狀態從簡單的 `pending/completed` 擴充為 `pending`, `dispatched`, `running`, `completed`, `failed`，讓任務的生命週期可以被完整追蹤。\n- 強化監督者：API 閘道器在啟動 Worker 子程序後，會建立一個監聽執行緒來捕獲 Worker 的 stdout/stderr，確保任何日誌或錯誤都不會丟失。\n- 賦予工人回報責任：Worker 程序在啟動、完成或失敗時，都會主動透過 API 向主伺服器回報其狀態。同時加入了全域的「遺言」錯誤捕捉機制，以防止任何「無聲的崩潰」。\n\n2. Bug 修復 (Bug Fixes):\n在新的架構下，我們得以定位並修復一系列深層次的 Bug：\n- 前端 Payload 錯誤：修正了 `TaskUploader.vue`，使其在提交任務時，能正確地將 `task_id` 和 `file_path` 加入到請求的 payload 中。\n- 後端 NameError：修正了 `main.py` 中因忘記 `import os` 而導致的 `NameError`。\n- 後端依賴錯誤：修正了 Worker 子程序因未傳遞 `PYTHONPATH` 而無法找到 `requests` 模組的問題。\n- 後端通訊錯誤：修正了 Worker 因未獲取正確的 `API_PORT` 而無法向主伺服器回報狀態的問題。\n- 非同步錯誤：修正了 `state_manager` 中因直接呼叫 coroutine 而導致 WebSocket 狀態廣播從未被發送的 `RuntimeWarning`。\n- 測試腳本錯誤：更新了 `e2e_test.py`，使其斷言與當前的 UI 狀態保持一致。\n\n經過這一系列的修改，`e2e_test.py` 現在可以穩定通過，證明了整個前後端任務處理流程已被完全打通。","tree":{"sha":"7ed211e2024229c3c9cd1165b8bbd2d1790551e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/7ed211e2024229c3c9cd1165b8bbd2d1790551e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/c968d310d49f46bf4cccaff4f4fb506402cd8345","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c968d310d49f46bf4cccaff4f4fb506402cd8345","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGM5NjhkMzEwZDQ5ZjQ2YmY0Y2NjYWZmNGY0ZmI1MDY0MDJjZDgzNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c1146e1ae838b02148e8a49bee28cce6919a11e0","sha":"c1146e1ae838b02148e8a49bee28cce6919a11e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c1146e1ae838b02148e8a49bee28cce6919a11e0"}],"sha":"c968d310d49f46bf4cccaff4f4fb506402cd8345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c968d310d49f46bf4cccaff4f4fb506402cd8345"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c1146e1ae838b02148e8a49bee28cce6919a11e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-25T07:26:02Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-25T07:26:02Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(gateway): connect state_manager to websocket broadcaster\n\nThis commit fixes a critical bug where status updates from background workers were not being broadcast to the frontend via WebSockets.\n\nThe root cause was a missing connection between the `state_manager` and the `broadcast_patch` function in `services/api_gateway/main.py`.\n\nThe fix is to register the `broadcast_patch` function as a listener to the `state_manager` on application startup. This ensures that any state change generates a patch that is immediately broadcast to all connected clients, restoring real-time UI updates.\n\nThe solution was validated by creating a dedicated integration test that reproduced the failure and then passed after the fix was applied. The full E2E test suite also passes, confirming no regressions were introduced.","tree":{"sha":"ba346860ed791a3897e81d62da2f38c9026eb464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/ba346860ed791a3897e81d62da2f38c9026eb464"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/c1146e1ae838b02148e8a49bee28cce6919a11e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c1146e1ae838b02148e8a49bee28cce6919a11e0","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGMxMTQ2ZTFhZTgzOGIwMjE0OGU4YTQ5YmVlMjhjY2U2OTE5YTExZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/0fc1614074e0b5586cb09e33d7c790195f4bcc68","sha":"0fc1614074e0b5586cb09e33d7c790195f4bcc68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/0fc1614074e0b5586cb09e33d7c790195f4bcc68"}],"sha":"c1146e1ae838b02148e8a49bee28cce6919a11e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c1146e1ae838b02148e8a49bee28cce6919a11e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/0fc1614074e0b5586cb09e33d7c790195f4bcc68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-25T07:10:12Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-25T07:10:12Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor(core): 後端任務架構重構與失敗歷程記錄\n\n本次提交標誌著一次為了解決核心功能失靈而進行的大規模後端架構重構。\n\n我們從最初的 `SqliteHuey` 死鎖問題出發，首先嘗試遷移至 `RedisHuey`（方案 A），但在這個過程中遇到了大量與沙箱環境相關的、難以解決的穩定性問題（如子程序管理、環境變數繼承等）。\n\n在與使用者溝通後，我們共同決定採取一個更激進但更穩定的策略（方案 B）：徹底移除 Huey 和 Redis 依賴，將架構簡化為由 FastAPI 直接透過 `subprocess.Popen` 呼叫獨立的 worker 腳本。\n\n這個重構是成功的，它極大地簡化了系統，並解決了所有已知的啟動崩潰問題。\n\n然而，在最終的端對端測試中，暴露出一個新的、也是最後一個問題：背景 worker 完成任務後，其狀態更新沒有成功地透過 WebSocket 反映到前端。\n\n所有的修改和詳細的除錯歷程、失敗分析、以及給下一位助理的建議，都已經詳細記錄在 `CH_log.md` 中。","tree":{"sha":"d5ff6c23ca74b028857a18cd560506f6e8917fd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/d5ff6c23ca74b028857a18cd560506f6e8917fd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/0fc1614074e0b5586cb09e33d7c790195f4bcc68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/0fc1614074e0b5586cb09e33d7c790195f4bcc68","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDBmYzE2MTQwNzRlMGI1NTg2Y2IwOWUzM2Q3Yzc5MDE5NWY0YmNjNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/8cddceb93a78259ff4fa43613f4198e51fad4606","sha":"8cddceb93a78259ff4fa43613f4198e51fad4606","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/8cddceb93a78259ff4fa43613f4198e51fad4606"}],"sha":"0fc1614074e0b5586cb09e33d7c790195f4bcc68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/0fc1614074e0b5586cb09e33d7c790195f4bcc68"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/8cddceb93a78259ff4fa43613f4198e51fad4606/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-25T04:59:13Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-25T04:59:13Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"docs(debug): 記錄核心功能失效的完整除錯歷程\n\n根據使用者指示，暫停修復，提交目前的問題狀態作為快照，並將詳細的除錯歷程記錄到變更日誌中。\n\n這份提交凍結了應用程式在一個已知的、可重現的失敗狀態，其中 `SqliteHuey` 後端被確定為是背景任務無法執行的根本原因。\n\n所有在除錯過程中建立的輔助工具（如 `e2e_test.py`）和對啟動流程的修復均已包含在內。這為後續的架構決策（例如，切換到 Redis 後端）提供了完整的上下文和一個穩定的測試基準。","tree":{"sha":"90b653ec3c714c7c3db51b66c49ac9fdd760dcd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/90b653ec3c714c7c3db51b66c49ac9fdd760dcd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/8cddceb93a78259ff4fa43613f4198e51fad4606","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/8cddceb93a78259ff4fa43613f4198e51fad4606","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDhjZGRjZWI5M2E3ODI1OWZmNGZhNDM2MTNmNDE5OGU1MWZhZDQ2MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/dab92c2491536acf16794545afad0e3c0dd58e7f","sha":"dab92c2491536acf16794545afad0e3c0dd58e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/dab92c2491536acf16794545afad0e3c0dd58e7f"}],"sha":"8cddceb93a78259ff4fa43613f4198e51fad4606","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/8cddceb93a78259ff4fa43613f4198e51fad4606"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/dab92c2491536acf16794545afad0e3c0dd58e7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-24T22:05:22Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T22:05:22Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(gateway): 建立並整合 API 閘道器以恢復前後端通訊\n\n此次提交的核心是建立了一個新的、基於 FastAPI 的 API 閘道器，以解決在架構升級後前端與後端完全失聯的問題。這個閘道器現在是前後端之間唯一的通訊中樞。\n\n主要變更：\n\n1.  **實作 API 閘道器 (`services/api_gateway`)**:\n    *   建立了一個全新的 FastAPI 應用，包含所有必要的 HTTP 和 WebSocket 端點。\n    *   HTTP 端點 (`/api/batch-tasks`, `/api/stage-file` 等) 負責接收前端請求，並將其轉換為 Huey 任務，分派到背景佇列中。\n    *   WebSocket 端點 (`/ws/status`) 負責與前端進行即時雙向通訊。\n\n2.  **整合即時狀態回報**:\n    *   閘道器與核心的 `state_manager` 進行了深度整合。\n    *   在啟動時，它會註冊一個監聽器。當背景 Worker 更新狀態時，`state_manager` 會產生一個 JSON Patch。\n    *   閘道器會透過 WebSocket 將這個 Patch 即時廣播給所有前端，確保了 UI 狀態的高效同步。\n    *   當客戶端首次連接時，會發送一份完整的後端狀態，以確保初始畫面的正確性。\n\n3.  **解決啟動流程問題**:\n    *   在除錯過程中，發現了因沙箱環境 `sys.path` 問題導致的嚴重 `ModuleNotFoundError`。\n    *   最終的解決方案是修改了依賴「烘烤」腳本 (`scripts/bake_dependencies.sh`)，將專案的原始碼 (`src`, `services`, `workers`) 也一併打包到依賴壓縮檔中，從根本上解決了模組載入問題，確保了伺服器的穩定啟動。\n\n4.  **恢復前端服務**:\n    *   為 API 閘道器新增了靜態檔案服務功能，使其能夠正確地提供 Vue 前端應用 (`index.html` 及其資源檔)。\n\n成果：\n這個新的通訊中樞成功地將前端介面與後端微服務重新連接起來，恢復了系統的核心功能。所有的後端服務現在都可以透過這個統一的閘道器被前端呼叫。","tree":{"sha":"7be6d81249cc5e1441b8d541e083189b63ca466d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/7be6d81249cc5e1441b8d541e083189b63ca466d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/dab92c2491536acf16794545afad0e3c0dd58e7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/dab92c2491536acf16794545afad0e3c0dd58e7f","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGRhYjkyYzI0OTE1MzZhY2YxNjc5NDU0NWFmYWQwZTNjMGRkNThlN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c6747643febd26510b62d208c8a1bc8170e57940","sha":"c6747643febd26510b62d208c8a1bc8170e57940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c6747643febd26510b62d208c8a1bc8170e57940"}],"sha":"dab92c2491536acf16794545afad0e3c0dd58e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/dab92c2491536acf16794545afad0e3c0dd58e7f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt