保前端服務**:\n    *   為 API 閘道器新增了靜態檔案服務功能，使其能夠正確地提供 Vue 前端應用 (`index.html` 及其資源檔)。\n\n成果：\n這個新的通訊中樞成功地將前端介面與後端微服務重新連接起來，恢復了系統的核心功能。所有的後端服務現在都可以透過這個統一的閘道器被前端呼叫。","tree":{"sha":"36c417de2ba69239326518e1b1da7bf61d76333b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/36c417de2ba69239326518e1b1da7bf61d76333b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/c6747643febd26510b62d208c8a1bc8170e57940","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c6747643febd26510b62d208c8a1bc8170e57940","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGM2NzQ3NjQzZmViZDI2NTEwYjYyZDIwOGM4YTFiYzgxNzBlNTc5NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/686e9338fcf777a25ee5b13482aaa872f91d8d9e","sha":"686e9338fcf777a25ee5b13482aaa872f91d8d9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/686e9338fcf777a25ee5b13482aaa872f91d8d9e"}],"sha":"c6747643febd26510b62d208c8a1bc8170e57940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c6747643febd26510b62d208c8a1bc8170e57940"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/686e9338fcf777a25ee5b13482aaa872f91d8d9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-24T20:07:11Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T20:07:11Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(colab): 恢復 v10 的多項核心功能與樣式\n\n- **動機**: 根據使用者回饋，v13 版本雖然架構穩定，但遺失了 v10 版本中的多項關鍵功能和樣式細節。本次更新旨在將其完全恢復。\n- **核心變更**:\n    - **恢復 Colab 代理重試**: 為 `_get_colab_url` 函式加入了 10 次重試機制，顯著提高了在不穩定網路下的成功率。\n    - **恢復 Localtunnel 密碼獲取**: `_run_tunnel_service` 現在會為 Localtunnel 自動執行 `curl` 來獲取隧道密碼，並由 `DisplayManager` 在 UI 上顯示，解決了 `bypass-tunnel-reminder` 無法完全免密碼的問題。\n    - **恢復 HTML 報告樣式**: `create_log_viewer_html` 函式的 CSS 樣式被完全還原為 v10 版本的樣式，包括按鈕、背景、邊框和字體等。\n    - **版本更新**: `Colabpro.py` 版本號更新至 `v13.1`。\n- **成果**: 新版本現在完全兼容 v10 的功能集和外觀，同時保留了 v12/v13 的穩定架構。","tree":{"sha":"e4d2d3a3702d70cfaa8904104f394ee611454eac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/e4d2d3a3702d70cfaa8904104f394ee611454eac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/686e9338fcf777a25ee5b13482aaa872f91d8d9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http