le-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T19:55:45Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(ui): 恢復並整合 v10 的多項 UI 功能\n\n- **動機**: 根據使用者要求，將舊版 `Colabpro.py` (v10) 中成功的使用者介面設計，與 v12 的穩定後端架構相結合，創造最佳體驗。\n- **核心變更**:\n    - **即時日誌顯示**: `DisplayManager` 被重構，加入了日誌佇列 (`deque`)，現在可以在動態刷新的 UI 中顯示即時的日誌訊息流。\n    - **效能監控恢復**: 重新引入了 `psutil` 套件，在 UI 的狀態行中加入了即時的 CPU 與 RAM 使用率監控。\n    - **HTML 報告恢復**: `create_log_viewer_html` 函式被加回 `Colabpro.py`，並在程式結束時透過 `display(HTML(...))` 呼叫，恢復了可摺疊、可複製的最終日誌報告功能。\n    - **配置更新**: 將預設 Git 分支更新為 `689`。\n    - **版本更新**: `Colabpro.py` 版本號更新至 `v13`。\n- **成果**: 新版本的啟動器現在不僅擁有穩定的後端架構和啟動流程，還具備了先前版本中所有受使用者歡迎的、資訊豐富的 UI 功能。","tree":{"sha":"74e82513ad1018052e8f9d089696d779d278099f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/74e82513ad1018052e8f9d089696d779d278099f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/5788470ac2d106753be892bf33105004c6eb4901","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred