s://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/27d1c8e8c7c5f22fa5e9187ff0e4183e0787cecc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-24T17:53:14Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T17:53:14Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor: 正式化「預先烘烤依賴」策略並簡化工作流程\n\n此提交將先前成功的「預先烘烤依賴」POC (概念驗證) 正式化，並將其完全整合進專案的標準工作流程中。\n\n主要變更如下：\n\n1.  **清理舊啟動腳本**:\n    *   刪除了已被 `run.py` 完全取代的舊版啟動器 `src/core/orchestrator.py`，使專案結構更清晰。\n\n2.  **更新重構計畫**:\n    *   根據 POC 的性能測量結果（解壓縮耗時約 0.36 秒），在 `REFACTOR_PLAN.md` 中正式將「方案三：實現分段啟動」標記為「已取消」，因其已不再必要。\n    *   新增了「方案零」，將「預先烘烤」策略記錄為專案的依賴管理基礎設施。\n\n3.  **整合測試流程**:\n    *   建立了一個新的 `conftest.py` 檔案，並在其中定義了一個全域的 `pytest` fixture。\n    *   此 fixture 會在所有測試開始前，自動執行依賴烘烤與環境準備，確保測試總是在一個與生產環境一致的、乾淨的環境中運行。\n    *   `test_api_service.py` 已被重構以使用此 fixture。\n    *   刪除了獨立的 `test_baking_poc.py` 腳本。\n\n4.  **更新文件**:\n    *   大幅更新了 `README.md`，移除了所有關於舊啟動方式 (`runner/`) 的說明。\n    *   新增了「開發與執行指南」，詳細介紹了基於 `scripts/bake_dependencies.sh` 和 `python run.py` 的新標準化工作流程。","tree":{"sha":"09ecaa489720ebbd343c7a3f850e2432d9302dcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/09ecaa489720ebbd343c7a3f850e2432d9302dcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/27d1c8e8c7c5f22fa5e9187ff0e4183e0787cecc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist