eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/979750e42d9ed4a0ff6d0c7373eefb1f92b30588/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-24T14:58:50Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T14:58:50Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"docs: 更新重構計畫並記錄新的依賴管理策略\n\n根據與使用者的討論，對專案的關鍵文件進行了更新，以反映最新的開發策略和狀態。\n\n主要變更:\n\n1.  **更新 `REFACTOR_PLAN.md`**:\n    - 在文件頂部新增了「進度總覽」表格，標示了三個核心方案的當前狀態。\n    - 在文件末尾新增了「附錄：依賴管理策略的演進」，詳細記錄了從「分段啟動」遇到的問題，到最終確定採用「預先烘烤」策略的完整思考過程和技術細節。\n\n2.  **更名變更日誌**:\n    - 將 `CHANGELOG.md` 重新命名為 `CH_log.md`。\n    - 更新了專案中所有對舊檔名的引用。\n\n3.  **記錄變更**:\n    - 在新的 `CH_log.md` 中新增了條目，記錄了本次的所有文件變更。\n\n這些變更確保了專案的計畫文件與當前的開發狀態和未來方向保持一致。","tree":{"sha":"adda0f85da1654cae6d7416346a8ed6b55306faa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/adda0f85da1654cae6d7416346a8ed6b55306faa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/979750e42d9ed4a0ff6d0c7373eefb1f92b30588","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https:/