69871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/bbe2c7da610591b57de0ce1dc9cff5ed017f518d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-24T08:57:48Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T08:57:48Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"docs: 建立並擴充架構重構計畫書\n\n根據對當前專案架構的深入分析，並為了指導未來的系統性重構，執行了以下文件方面的工作：\n\n1.  **建立 `REFACTOR_PLAN.md`**: 在專案根目錄下建立了一份詳盡的重構計畫書。該計畫書深入分析了目前的技術痛點（特別是圍繞 Huey 和複雜的啟動流程），並提出了一套包含「統一後端」、「模型註冊表」和「分段啟動」的綜合性重構策略。\n\n2.  **擴充計畫書，加入後端測試策略**: 在 `REFACTOR_PLAN.md` 中新增了「後端測試策略」章節。該策略提出了一個分三層的測試金字塔模型（單元測試、服務級整合測試、系統級整合測試），旨在為重構工作建立一個可靠的安全網。\n\n此提交不包含任何應用程式的程式碼變更，專注於為未來的重構工作提供清晰的、經過討論的指導藍圖。","tree":{"sha":"0ead434c4c88dcb2fd6e210a84d53926c6cf46c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/0ead434c4c88dcb2fd6e210a84d53926c6cf46c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/bbe2c7da610591b57de0ce1dc9cff5ed017f518d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/pri