s-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/d01e7eaf73cc1a5d1bde502ba7ec6f3bc8fcfd56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-24T08:48:36Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T08:48:36Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"docs: 建立架構重構與穩定性提升計畫書\n\n根據對當前專案架構的深入分析，建立了一份詳盡的重構計畫書 `REFACTOR_PLAN.md`。\n\n該計畫書主要包含以下內容：\n- 對當前圍繞 Huey 和複雜啟動流程的不穩定性的根本原因分析。\n- 推薦的「統一後端」方案，將 Huey consumer 內建模組化，以解決程序管理和導入鏈問題。\n- 推薦的「模型註冊表」方案 (`models.json`)，以解決 AI 模型規格管理混亂的問題。\n- 結合「分段啟動」的構想，闡述如何實現依賴和模型的延遲載入。\n\n此文件旨在為未來的系統性重構工作提供清晰的指導藍圖。","tree":{"sha":"74efa2dca60fa7245678d707c734827fc3304b13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/74efa2dca60fa7245678d707c734827fc3304b13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/d01e7eaf73cc1a5d1bde502ba7ec6f3bc8fcfd56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g