tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/41d7a2d5b045d4bd2c43ba3e0294248c708c9049/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-23T15:16:11Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-23T15:16:11Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(deps): 改用 uv 取代 pip 進行依賴管理\n\n將主要的 Python 依賴安裝工具從 pip 更換為 uv，以提升安裝速度和可靠性。\n\n主要變更：\n- 在 `run_app.py` 中新增了 `ensure_uv_installed` 函式，用於自動檢查並安裝 uv。此函式模仿了現有的 `ensure_bun_installed` 的邏輯。\n- 將 `run_app.py` 中的 `pip install -r` 指令替換為 `uv pip install -r`。\n- 更新了相關的日誌訊息以反映此變更。","tree":{"sha":"6bf6b79045a5ab31cf0d722d8fc001a575ee8847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/6bf6b79045a5ab31cf0d722d8fc001a575ee8847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/41d7a2d5b045d4bd2c43ba3e0294248c708c9049","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/41d7a2d5b045d4bd2c43ba3e0294248c708c9049","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDQxZDdhMmQ1YjA0NWQ0YmQyYzQzYmEzZTAyOTQyNDhjNzA4YzkwNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/5cd988469c385207eed8ae5624e2598969186119","sha":"5cd988469c385207eed8ae5624e2598969186119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/5cd988469c385207eed8ae5624e2598969186119"}],"sha":"41d7a2d5b045d4bd2c43ba3e0294248c708c9049","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/41d7a2d5b045d4bd2c43ba3e0294248c708c9049"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/5cd988469c385207eed8ae5624e2598969186119/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-23T13:45:04Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-23T13:45:04Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"本次提交旨在修復一個導致前端儀表板無數據、所有背景功能癱瘓的核心架構問題。\n\n根本原因分析：\n1.  **背景工作程序未啟動**：主啟動腳本 `run_app.py` 遺漏了啟動 `Huey` 背景消費者程序的關鍵步驟。\n2.  **硬體監控功能缺失**：用於填充儀表板數據的 `HardwareMonitorWorker` 程式碼完全不存在。\n3.  **依賴安裝不完整**：啟動腳本未安裝 `requirements-worker.txt` 中定義的工作程序依賴。\n4.  **前端建置可能陳舊**：`run_app.py` 不會自動清理舊的前端建置。\n\n實施的解決方案：\n1.  **新建硬體監控工作程序** (`workers/hardware_monitor_worker.py`)，使用 `psutil` 定期收集系統狀態。\n2.  **建立內部通訊 API** (`/api/internal/system_update`)，允許工作程序將狀態回報給 API 閘道，再由其透過 WebSocket 廣播至前端。\n3.  **修復主啟動腳本** (`run_app.py`)：\n    - 新增了啟動 `huey_consumer.py` 的邏輯。\n    - 新增了安裝 `requirements-worker.txt` 的指令。\n    - 強制清理舊的 `dist` 目錄以確保前端為最新版本。\n4.  **修復前端 Store** (`vue-app/src/stores/tasks.js`)，使其能正確初始化並處理系統狀態的 WebSocket 訊息。\n5.  **更新依賴**：將 `psutil` 加入 `requirements-worker.txt`。\n\n**驗證說明**：\n由於開發環境中的工具鏈（特別是檔案讀寫和指令執行方面）持續出現嚴重故障，我無法完成端對端 (E2E) 的自動化測試驗證。儘管如此，所有程式碼層面的修改都已完成，並且是基於詳細的日誌分析和根本原因定位。此提交有很高的信心能夠解決使用者回報的問題。\n\n**CHANGELOG 更新**：\n已遵照 `AGENTS.md` 的指示，新增了詳細的變更日誌條目。","tree":{"sha":"caa3c8504810e85139a1a9c3e3de14ed490ee16c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/caa3c8504810e85139a1a9c3e3de14ed490ee16c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/5cd988469c385207eed8ae5624e2598969186119","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/5cd988469c385207eed8ae5624e2598969186119","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDVjZDk4ODQ2OWMzODUyMDdlZWQ4YWU1NjI0ZTI1OTg5NjkxODYxMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c42a2bf4fc1389ad904111ec45417671e2983488","sha":"c42a2bf4fc1389ad904111ec45417671e2983488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c42a2bf4fc1389ad904111ec45417671e2983488"}],"sha":"5cd988469c385207eed8ae5624e2598969186119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/5cd988469c385207eed8ae5624e2598969186119"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c42a2bf4fc1389ad904111ec45417671e2983488/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-23T13:01:00Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-23T13:01:00Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"根據使用者回饋，對 `Colabpro.py` 進行了健壯性增強與設定更新。\n\n1.  **將健康檢查改為非致命性**:\n    - **問題**: 先前的設計中，任何一項健康檢查失敗都會直接中止整個應用程式的啟動，過於嚴格。\n    - **解決方案**: 修改了 `launch_application` 函式的邏輯。現在，即使有健康檢查失敗，程式也只會記錄一條警告日誌，然後繼續嘗試啟動後續服務。\n    - **成果**: 大幅提高了程式的健壯性，即使在部分環境功能（如 Colab 代理）不穩定的情況下，使用者仍有機會透過備用代理（如 `localtunnel`）成功啟動服務。\n\n2.  **新增 Colab 代理可用性健康檢查**:\n    - **動機**: 為了在啟動早期階段就能偵測到 Colab 官方代理服務的潛在問題。\n    - **實作**: 新增了一個名為 `check_colab_proxy_availability` 的健康檢查項目。此檢查會啟動一個暫時的本地伺服器，並嘗試透過 `google.colab.kernel.proxyPort` 為其獲取一個公開網址。\n\n3.  **更新預設 Git 分支**:\n    - 將預設下載的後端程式碼分支 `TARGET_BRANCH_OR_TAG` 從 `\"365\"` 更新為 `\"645\"`。","tree":{"sha":"b21b7e2c7010fc0e7710765e2bbca0c8580516b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/b21b7e2c7010fc0e7710765e2bbca0c8580516b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/c42a2bf4fc1389ad904111ec45417671e2983488","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c42a2bf4fc1389ad904111ec45417671e2983488","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGM0MmEyYmY0ZmMxMzg5YWQ5MDQxMTFlYzQ1NDE3NjcxZTI5ODM0ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/394074b186340557a48e2cdb33c6db42755b6e11","sha":"394074b186340557a48e2cdb33c6db42755b6e11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/394074b186340557a48e2cdb33c6db42755b6e11"}],"sha":"c42a2bf4fc1389ad904111ec45417671e2983488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c42a2bf4fc1389ad904111ec45417671e2983488"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/394074b186340557a48e2cdb33c6db42755b6e11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-23T12:54:14Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-23T12:54:14Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"根據使用者要求，對 `Colabpro.py` 進行了健壯性增強與設定更新。\n\n1.  **新增 Colab 代理可用性健康檢查**:\n    - **動機**: 為了在啟動早期階段就能偵測到 Colab 官方代理服務的潛在問題。\n    - **實作**: 新增了一個名為 `check_colab_proxy_availability` 的健康檢查項目。此檢查會啟動一個暫時的本地伺服器，並嘗試透過 `google.colab.kernel.proxyPort` 為其獲取一個公開網址。\n    - **成果**: 只有在代理服務被確認為可用時，主應用程式才會繼續啟動，提高了啟動流程的可靠性。\n\n2.  **更新預設 Git 分支**:\n    - 將預設下載的後端程式碼分支 `TARGET_BRANCH_OR_TAG` 從 `\"365\"` 更新為 `\"645\"`。","tree":{"sha":"1889eaa14fd0ddb8e3e3e6e7453f15f35b5aac13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/1889eaa14fd0ddb8e3e3e6e7453f15f35b5aac13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/394074b186340557a48e2cdb33c6db42755b6e11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/394074b186340557a48e2cdb33c6db42755b6e11","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDM5NDA3NGIxODYzNDA1NTdhNDhlMmNkYjMzYzZkYjQyNzU1YjZlMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/611b9394f0f43d9dfa8d24b0082c4b55a8f785c7","sha":"611b9394f0f43d9dfa8d24b0082c4b55a8f785c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/611b9394f0f43d9dfa8d24b0082c4b55a8f785c7"}],"sha":"394074b186340557a48e2cdb33c6db42755b6e11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/394074b186340557a48e2cdb33c6db42755b6e11"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/611b9394f0f43d9dfa8d24b0082c4b55a8f785c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-23T11:19:47Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-23T11:19:47Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(colab): 修正 Colabpro.py 本地測試模式\n\n問題：\n直接執行 `python Colabpro.py` 會因缺少 `IPython` 函式庫而立即崩潰退出。\n\n根本原因：\n腳本頂層的 `from IPython.display import ...` 是一個硬性依賴，在沒有安裝 IPython 的標準 Python 環境中會導致 `ImportError`。\n\n解決方案：\n將 `IPython.display` 的匯入操作包裹在一個 `try...except ImportError` 區塊中。當偵測到非 IPython 環境時，會建立一個模擬的、無操作的 `display` 函式，讓腳本的其餘部分可以繼續正常執行，從而恢復本地測試模式的功能。","tree":{"sha":"a2037226cc358a58fd91e2fd7c3968d9226ce7e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/a2037226cc358a58fd91e2fd7c3968d9226ce7e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/611b9394f0f43d9dfa8d24b0082c4b55a8f785c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/611b9394f0f43d9dfa8d24b0082c4b55a8f785c7","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDYxMWI5Mzk0ZjBmNDNkOWRmYThkMjRiMDA4MmM0YjU1YThmNzg1Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/6480604befeb312b11dbd922f7a7e046a5788698","sha":"6480604befeb312b11dbd922f7a7e046a5788698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/6480604befeb312b11dbd922f7a7e046a5788698"}],"sha":"611b9394f0f43d9dfa8d24b0082c4b55a8f785c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/611b9394f0f43d9dfa8d24b0082c4b55a8f785c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/6480604befeb312b11dbd922f7a7e046a5788698/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-23T11:06:41Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-23T11:06:41Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(colab): 重構 Colabpro 啟動器並修復後端啟動流程\n\n本次提交對 Colab 啟動器 (`Colabpro.py`) 和後端協調器 (`run_app.py`) 進行了重大重構，以解決核心的穩定性問題並增強功能。\n\n主要變更：\n\n1.  **修復後端服務啟動時序問題**:\n    - **問題**: `API Gateway` 常常因為 `DB Manager` 未及時啟動而崩潰。\n    - **解決方案**: 在 `run_app.py` 中加入了明確的服務啟動順序。現在會先啟動 `DB Manager`，並等待其「就緒」信號檔案被建立後，才啟動 `API Gateway`，徹底解決了服務之間的競爭條件。\n\n2.  **整合環境健康診斷儀**:\n    - 在 `Colabpro.py` 啟動初期加入了一系列健康檢查（外部網路、埠號分配、前後端通訊）。\n    - 如果任何檢查失敗，啟動程序會提前終止並顯示詳細的錯誤報告，為使用者提供清晰的反饋，避免長時間的無效等待。\n\n3.  **整合併發代理獲取器**:\n    - 使用者提供的「併發競速」邏輯取代了原有的代理獲取器。\n    - 新的實作會同時嘗試 `Colab`、`localtunnel` 和 `cloudflare` 三種隧道方案，並將所有成功的公開網址都顯示出來，作為備用選項，極大提升了連線成功率。\n\n4.  **更新 Colabpro 設定**:\n    - 根據使用者要求，將預設分支更新為 `365`。\n    - 更新了啟動器的標題和開發者日誌，以反映最新的版本和功能。","tree":{"sha":"add085fca32551ec8e65569a6bf8afe79dccd8bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/add085fca32551ec8e65569a6bf8afe79dccd8bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/6480604befeb312b11dbd922f7a7e046a5788698","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscript