","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/d2990d57b693569687b182d272a719ac2a1e756e","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGQyOTkwZDU3YjY5MzU2OTY4N2IxODJkMjcyYTcxOWFjMmExZTc1NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c8c6f2e67122927fbd26e193ac0ed438cd1d3f11","sha":"c8c6f2e67122927fbd26e193ac0ed438cd1d3f11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c8c6f2e67122927fbd26e193ac0ed438cd1d3f11"}],"sha":"d2990d57b693569687b182d272a719ac2a1e756e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/d2990d57b693569687b182d272a719ac2a1e756e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c8c6f2e67122927fbd26e193ac0ed438cd1d3f11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T22:56:40Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T22:56:40Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"重構：恢復 Colabpro 啟動器的穩定性並統一執行環境\n\n本次提交對 `Colabpro.py` 啟動器進行了關鍵的穩定性修復，並進一步簡化了專案的執行架構，以解決使用者回報的幾個問題。\n\n主要變更：\n\n1.  **恢復穩健的 URL 獲取邏輯**：\n    *   在 `Colabpro.py` 中，重新引入了舊版中經過驗證的、更穩健的 Colab 代理 URL 獲取機制。\n    *   此機制使用獨立的執行緒，並包含對 JavaScript 執行和 Python 等待的雙重超時處理，以及多次自動重試功能，從根本上解決了因競爭條件導致的無法穩定獲取代理連結的問題。\n\n2.  **統一背景工作者環境**：\n    *   簡化了 `src/core/background_tasks.py`，完全移除了為背景工作者建立獨立虛擬環境的邏輯。\n    *   此修改確保了所有子程序都在由 `run_app.py` 準備的單一、統一環境中執行，解決了因環境不一致導致的 `uv not found` 錯誤。\n\n3.  **修復前端日誌錯誤**：\n    *   暫時停用了 `vue-app/src/utils/logging.js` 中對一個不存在的後端 API `/api/log/action` 的呼叫，消除了前端大量的 `405` 網路錯誤，使網頁恢復正常。\n\n4.  **增加伺服器啟動延遲**：\n    *   在 `run_app.py` 中新增了 15 秒的等待時間，確保在 `Colabpro.py` 嘗試獲取代理 URL 之前，後端伺服器有充足的時間完成初始化。\n\n5.  **更新設定**：\n    *   根據要求，將 `Colabpro.py` 中的預設分支更新為 `610`。","tree":{"sha":"cffe59a34a666b1e296094ed83470480f78d82d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/cffe59a34a666b1e296094ed83470480f78d82d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/c8c6f2e67122927fbd26e193ac0ed438cd1d3f11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c8c6f2e67122927fbd26e193ac0ed438cd1d3f11","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGM4YzZmMmU2NzEyMjkyN2ZiZDI2ZTE5M2FjMGVkNDM4Y2QxZDNmMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/1026433dd981f9843eaa1ac838759399509b7fb5","sha":"1026433dd981f9843eaa1ac838759399509b7fb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/1026433dd981f9843eaa1ac838759399509b7fb5"}],"sha":"c8c6f2e67122927fbd26e193ac0ed438cd1d3f11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c8c6f2e67122927fbd26e193ac0ed438cd1d3f11"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/1026433dd981f9843eaa1ac838759399509b7fb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T15:15:44Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T15:15:44Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"test: 遷移 E2E 測試至混合式 Python/JS 執行器\n\n此提交重構了端對端測試策略，以實現測試執行器的現代化，並解決了執行環境的限制。\n\n先前的 E2E 測試是單一的 Python 腳本 (`test.py`)。此提交將其替換為一個新的混合模式：\n- 一個 Python 腳本 (`run_e2e_test.py`) 負責流程控制。\n- 一個 Node.js 腳本 (`run_browser_test.js`) 負責瀏覽器自動化。\n\n此方法旨在繞過因檔案數量限制而導致 `npm install` 在 `vue-app` 目錄中失敗的問題。\n\n新的測試框架成功地指出了 UI 問題的根本原因：Vue 應用程式在 Playwright 瀏覽器中未能正確掛載。","tree":{"sha":"4a3cdc3f845399b190395f831bdbeea60a44c678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/4a3cdc3f845399b190395f831bdbeea60a44c678"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/1026433dd981f9843eaa1ac838759399509b7fb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/1026433dd981f9843eaa1ac838759399509b7fb5","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDEwMjY0MzNkZDk4MWY5ODQzZWFhMWFjODM4NzU5Mzk5NTA5YjdmYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/f4a6a58b50fd35738684e4040a3e371b29efdda9","sha":"f4a6a58b50fd35738684e4040a3e371b29efdda9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/f4a6a58b50fd35738684e4040a3e371b29efdda9"}],"sha":"1026433dd981f9843eaa1ac838759399509b7fb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/1026433dd981f9843eaa1ac838759399509b7fb5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/f4a6a58b50fd35738684e4040a3e371b29efdda9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T13:38:11Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T13:38:11Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"The key findings are:\n- The official Vue.js documentation strongly recommends **Vitest** for unit and component testing in Vite-based projects, as it is created by the Vue/Vite team and shares the same configuration pipeline.\n- For E2E testing, while Playwright is a recommended tool, the standard practice is to use its native JavaScript/TypeScript test runner from within the frontend project, not a Python script.\n\nThis research validates the new testing strategy: replace the Python-based `test.py` with a JavaScript-based E2E test using Playwright''s native runner.","tree":{"sha":"e17791d3d88a7bd4ba4c07d2084c689f034862ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/e17791d3d88a7bd4ba4c07d2084c689f034862ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/f4a6a58b50fd35738684e4040a3e371b29efdda9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/f4a6a58b50fd35738684e4040a3e371b29efdda9","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGY0YTZhNThiNTBmZDM1NzM4Njg0ZTQwNDBhM2UzNzFiMjllZmRkYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/abe79d996581cb7ef7d4110cfa2db1aabe292fc3","sha":"abe79d996581cb7ef7d4110cfa2db1aabe292fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/abe79d996581cb7ef7d4110cfa2db1aabe292fc3"}],"sha":"f4a6a58b50fd35738684e4040a3e371b29efdda9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/f4a6a58b50fd35738684e4040a3e371b29efdda9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/abe79d996581cb7ef7d4110cfa2db1aabe292fc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T08:35:17Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T08:35:17Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"The key findings are:\n- The official Vue.js documentation strongly recommends **Vitest** for unit and component testing in Vite-based projects, as it is created by the Vue/Vite team and shares the same configuration pipeline.\n- For E2E testing, while Playwright is a recommended tool, the standard practice is to use its native JavaScript/TypeScript test runner from within the frontend project, not a Python script.\n\nThis research validates the new testing strategy: replace the Python-based `test.py` with a JavaScript-based E2E test using Playwright''s native runner.","tree":{"sha":"e17791d3d88a7bd4ba4c07d2084c689f034862ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/e17791d3d88a7bd4ba4c07d2084c689f034862ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/abe79d996581cb7ef7d4110cfa2db1aabe292fc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/abe79d996581cb7ef7d4110cfa2db1aabe292fc3","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGFiZTc5ZDk5NjU4MWNiN2VmN2Q0MTEwY2ZhMmRiMWFhYmUyOTJmYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/d52cfee966059ad241221ffd2717b40d95a0ae80","sha":"d52cfee966059ad241221ffd2717b40d95a0ae80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/d52cfee966059ad241221ffd2717b40d95a0ae80"}],"sha":"abe79d996581cb7ef7d4110cfa2db1aabe292fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/abe79d996581cb7ef7d4110cfa2db1aabe292fc3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/d52cfee966059ad241221ffd2717b40d95a0ae80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T07:13:09Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T07:13:09Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor: 全面重構為基於 Huey 任務佇列的架構\n\n本次提交根據與使用者的深入討論和研究，對整個應用程式的後端架構進行了根本性的重構，以解決啟動不穩定、服務靜默崩潰、前後端通訊失敗等一系列問題。\n\n核心變更：\n1.  **引入 Huey 任務佇列**: 徹底重構了服務間的通訊方式。舊有的直接導入和不穩定的 HTTP 呼叫，被替換為一個基於 `Huey` 的、穩健的非同步任務佇列系統。`api_gateway` 現在作為任務的唯一生產者，將工作（如轉錄、日誌記錄）放入佇列，由獨立的背景工作者消費。\n\n2.  **統一與隔離資料庫**:\n    *   **雙資料庫策略**：根據與使用者的深入討論，採用了雙資料庫隔離方案以提高穩定性。建立了一個獨立的 `logs.db` 用於日誌記錄，以及一個獨立的 `queue.db` 專供 Huey 任務佇列使用。\n    *   **中心化初始化**：`api_gateway` 現在是應用啟動的核心，它會在 `lifespan` 事件中，最優先初始化日誌資料庫（並啟用 WAL 模式以提高併發效能），然後才啟動所有背景工作者，從根本上解決了先前版本中存在的啟動時序競態條件問題。\n\n3.  **重構為工作者模式 (Worker Pattern)**:\n    *   建立了 `workers/` 目錄，並新增了 `transcription_worker.py` 和 `logging_worker.py`。\n    *   `background_tasks.py` 現在不再啟動多個獨立的服務，而是啟動一個 `huey_consumer.py` 程序來統一管理所有工作者的生命週期。\n\n4.  **API Gateway 職責整合**:\n    *   將原 `static_web_server` 的靜態檔案服務功能，以及 WebSocket 代理功能，全部整合進 `api_gateway`。\n    *   `api_gateway` 現在是名副其實的應用唯一入口點，負責處理所有 HTTP 請求、WebSocket 連線和前端檔案服務。\n\n5.  **強化端對端測試**:\n    *   `test.py` 被徹底重構，不再依賴 `Colabpro.py`，而是直接測試 `api_gateway`。\n    *   測試現在會動態尋找可用埠號，避免因埠號被佔用而導致的測試失敗。\n    *   Playwright 的驗證邏輯被加強，現在會實際檢查 UI 上的狀態文字 (`狀態: 準備就緒`)，確保前後端通訊真正成功。","tree":{"sha":"c54009c3b4b1999754e294bbb796d67d3572786b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/c54009c3b4b1999754e294bbb796d67d3572786b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/d52cfee966059ad241221ffd2717b40d95a0ae80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-l