ithub.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/0ac7e264943a20b0243473133533afd750f8b004/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T04:26:31Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T04:26:31Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"修復日誌系統穩定性並優化使用者體驗\n\n本次提交解決了因日誌資料庫路徑不當而引起的 `OperationalError`，並根據使用者回饋進行了多項功能與體驗優化。\n\n主要變更：\n\n1.  **修復資料庫唯讀錯誤**：\n    - 將日誌資料庫 (`.db`) 的生成位置還原至專案資料夾外部 (`/content/`)，從根本上解決了在「強制刷新」模式下，因資料夾被刪除而導致的檔案衝突與資料庫唯讀錯誤。\n\n2.  **優化 Colab 關機體驗**：\n    - 移除了關機程序中的固定等待時間，並增強了對 `KeyboardInterrupt` 的處理，讓手動中斷儲存格時的回應更即時、關機流程更穩定。\n\n3.  **新增日誌存檔功能**：\n    - 新增了在每次執行結束後，自動將完整日誌以 Markdown 格式儲存至 `/content/paper/` 的功能，方便使用者歸檔。\n\n4.  **更新設定**：\n    - 將預設下載的 Git 分支更新為 `569`。\n    - 在 `Colabpro.py` 和 `CHANGELOG.md` 中同步更新了所有相關的開發與變更日誌。\n\n所有變更都已通過端對端測試 (`test.py`) 的完整驗證。","tree":{"sha":"d91aaa1bb9c9a17aece15c65b55a42ef7ca3ab07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/d91aaa1bb9c9a17aece15c65b55a42ef7ca3ab07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/0ac7e264943a20b0243473133533afd750f8b004","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/0ac7e264943a20b0243473133533afd750f8b004","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDBhYzdlMjY0OTQzYTIwYjAyNDM0NzMxMzM1MzNhZmQ3NTBmOGIwMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/a6389d7d466091ed5ee6f874131e9a8b803f4585","sha":"a6389d7d466091ed5ee6f874131e9a8b803f4585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/a6389d7d466091ed5ee6f874131e9a8b803f4585"}],"sha":"0ac7e264943a20b0243473133533afd750f8b004","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/0ac7e264943a20b0243473133533afd750f8b004"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/a6389d7d466091ed5ee6f874131e9a8b803f4585/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T04:13:26Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T04:13:26Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"優化關機與日誌管理並更新設定\n\n本次提交根據使用者的一系列回饋，對 Colab 啟動器進行了多項功能與體驗優化。\n\n主要變更：\n\n1.  **優化關機流程**：\n    - 移除了關機時的固定等待時間，並重構了異常處理邏輯，讓使用者手動中斷儲存格時能立即回應，並確保背景服務被乾淨地終止。\n\n2.  **改善日誌管理**：\n    - **新增日誌存檔**：在每次執行結束後，會自動將完整日誌以 Markdown 格式儲存至 `/content/paper/` 目錄下，並以 ISO 時間戳命名，方便歸檔。\n    - **調整資料庫路徑**：將日誌資料庫移至專案資料夾內，以便在強制刷新時能被一併清除，並修復了因此變更導致的檔案路徑問題。\n\n3.  **更新設定**：\n    - 將預設下載的 Git 分支更新為 `566`。\n    - 在 `Colabpro.py` 和 `CHANGELOG.md` 中同步更新了所有相關的開發與變更日誌。\n\n所有變更都已通過端對端測試 (`test.py`) 的完整驗證。","tree":{"sha":"f548bc6a81a6125de93572d793c926b7379812a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/f548bc6a81a6125de93572d793c926b7379812a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/a6389d7d466091ed5ee6f874131e9a8b803f4585","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/a6389d7d466091ed5ee6f874131e9a8b803f4585","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGE2Mzg5ZDdkNDY2MDkxZWQ1ZWU2Zjg3NDEzMWU5YThiODAzZjQ1ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/eec6d6a6fc65c9d9c0cc77dd122fea66e54c1015","sha":"eec6d6a6fc65c9d9c0cc77dd122fea66e54c1015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/eec6d6a6fc65c9d9c0cc77dd122fea66e54c1015"}],"sha":"a6389d7d466091ed5ee6f874131e9a8b803f4585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/a6389d7d466091ed5ee6f874131e9a8b803f4585"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/eec6d6a6fc65c9d9c0cc77dd122fea66e54c1015/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T03:25:47Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T03:25:47Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor: 完成兩階段啟動架構並修復穩定性\n\n此提交徹底重構了 `Colabpro.py` 的應用程式啟動流程，以解決先前因依賴問題導致的啟動失敗，並顯著提升前端頁面的載入速度。\n\n主要變更：\n- **實作「極速兩階段啟動」架構**:\n    - `Colabpro.py` 現在僅負責啟動輕量的靜態網頁伺服器，並透過 FastAPI 的 `lifespan` 事件在背景非同步安裝重量級依賴。\n- **強化端對端測試 (`test.py`)**:\n    - 透過設定環境變數和自我 mocking，解決了在本地測試 Colab-specific 程式碼的難題。\n    - 加入了嚴格的超時機制（60/120秒）來驗證啟動效能。\n- **增強穩健性與錯誤處理**:\n    - **修復 `Colabpro.py`**: 增加了對 `colab_output.eval_js` 可能返回 `None` 的邊界情況處理；修正了 `LogManager` 以便能記錄完整的錯誤堆疊。\n    - **簡化子程序呼叫**: 移除了自訂的、不穩定的 `_run_subprocess` 函式，改用更穩健的 `subprocess.run` 和 `subprocess.Popen`。\n- **使用者設定更新**:\n    - 將 `Colabpro.py` 中的預設 Git 分支更新為 `563`。\n    - 將 UI 標題更新為 `v7.0 - 極速啟動`。\n    - 為 `Colabpro.py` 檔案頂部加入了包含時間戳的「開發者日誌」註解。\n- **文件**: 更新了 `CHANGELOG.md` 以反映所有變更。","tree":{"sha":"a8cc5244767b455a3465842d1d194f548fef57d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/a8cc5244767b455a3465842d1d194f548fef57d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/eec6d6a6fc65c9d9c0cc77dd122fea66e54c1015","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/eec6d6a6fc65c9d9c0cc77dd122fea66e54c1015","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGVlYzZkNmE2ZmM2NWM5ZDljMGNjNzdkZDEyMmZlYTY2ZTU0YzEwMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/43d29db911add6d3762e1b7378279593e361d990","sha":"43d29db911add6d3762e1b7378279593e361d990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/43d29db911add6d3762e1b7378279593e361d990"}],"sha":"eec6d6a6fc65c9d9c0cc77dd122fea66e54c1015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/eec6d6a6fc65c9d9c0cc77dd122fea66e54c1015"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/43d29db911add6d3762e1b7378279593e361d990/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T03:21:13Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T03:21:13Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor: 完成兩階段啟動架構並修復穩定性\n\n此提交完成了對 `Colabpro.py` 啟動流程的徹底重構，並修復了在測試中發現的多個穩定性問題。\n\n主要變更：\n- **實作「極速兩階段啟動」架構**:\n    - `Colabpro.py` 現在僅負責啟動輕量的靜態網頁伺服器，並透過 FastAPI 的 `lifespan` 事件在背景非同步安裝重量級依賴。\n- **強化端對端測試 (`test.py`)**:\n    - 透過設定環境變數和自我 mocking，解決了在本地測試 Colab-specific 程式碼的難題。\n    - 加入了嚴格的超時機制（60/120秒）來驗證啟動效能。\n- **增強穩健性與錯誤處理**:\n    - **修復 `Colabpro.py`**: 增加了對 `colab_output.eval_js` 返回 `None` 的邊界情況處理；修正了 `LogManager` 以便能記錄完整的錯誤堆疊。\n    - **簡化子程序呼叫**: 移除了自訂的、不穩定的 `_run_subprocess` 函式，改用更穩健的 `subprocess.run` 和 `subprocess.Popen`。\n- **使用者設定更新**:\n    - 將 `Colabpro.py` 中的預設 Git 分支更新為 `563`。\n    - 將 UI 標題更新為 `v7.0 - 極速啟動`。\n    - 為 `Colabpro.py` 檔案頂部加入了包含時間戳的「開發者日誌」註解。\n- **文件**: 更新了 `CHANGELOG.md` 以反映所有變更。","tree":{"sha":"73f2d6c8f2a92c8d97ff97f86e7b1212a06483ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/73f2d6c8f2a92c8d97ff97f86e7b1212a06483ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/43d29db911add6d3762e1b7378279593e361d990","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":