jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/318593615454e948f556236f9f26863ba89f2524/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T03:16:12Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T03:16:12Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor: 實作極速兩階段啟動架構並修復穩定性問題\n\n此提交徹底重構了 `Colabpro.py` 的應用程式啟動流程，以解決先前因依賴問題導致的啟動失敗，並顯著提升前端頁面的載入速度。\n\n主要變更：\n- **實作「極速兩階段啟動」架構**:\n    - **解耦啟動流程**: `Colabpro.py` 現在僅負責啟動一個輕量的靜態網頁伺服器，讓使用者可以立即看到 UI。\n    - **非同步背景安裝**: 所有重量級服務的依賴安裝，都被移至由 FastAPI 的 `lifespan` 事件觸發的 `asyncio` 背景任務中，不再阻塞主流程。\n- **強化端對端測試**:\n    - 重構了 `test.py` 驗證腳本，使其能夠模擬 Colab 環境（透過 Mock `google.colab` 模組）並加入嚴格的超時（60/120秒）來驗證新的兩階段啟動流程。\n- **增強穩健性**:\n    - **修復 Colab 通訊錯誤**: 增加了對 `colab_output.eval_js` 可能返回 `None` 的邊界情況處理，避免了 `AttributeError`。\n    - **修復日誌系統錯誤**: 修正了 `LogManager`，使其能正確處理 `exc_info` 參數，以便在發生未預期錯誤時能記錄完整的錯誤堆疊。\n- **使用者設定更新**:\n    - 將 `Colabpro.py` 中的預設 Git 分支更新為 `563`。\n    - 將 UI 標題更新為 `v7.0 - 極速啟動`。\n- **文件**: 更新了 `CHANGELOG.md` 以反映所有變更。","tree":{"sha":"cc92d28701267a1ab660c22de94323ffa2b2b538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/cc92d28701267a1ab660c22de94323ffa2b2b538"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/318593615454e948f556236f9f26863ba89f2524","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/