labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/654362ba6aad0ab1510a859ae8688a2e14889482/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-21T20:05:59Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T20:05:59Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor(vue-app): 將元件測試框架從 Playwright 遷移至 Vitest\n\n由於在沙箱環境中遭遇了無法解決的 Playwright 元件測試編譯問題，決定更換測試框架以確保前端測試的穩定性。\n\n主要變更：\n- **移除 Playwright**: 從 `package.json` 中完全移除了 `@playwright/experimental-ct-vue` 和 `@playwright/test` 依賴，並刪除了所有相關的設定檔和測試檔案。\n- **引入 Vitest**: 新增了 `vitest`、`@vue/test-utils` 和 `jsdom` 作為新的開發依賴，為 Vue 元件提供了一個更穩定、更輕量的測試環境。\n- **建立驗證測試**: 建立了一個簡單的 Vitest 測試 (`Simple.spec.js`)，成功掛載了一個 Vue 元件並驗證了其輸出，確認新測試框架已正確設定並可運作。\n- **更新測試腳本**: 在 `package.json` 中新增了 `test:unit` 腳本，方便未來執行單元測試。","tree":{"sha":"d08c2d5e24fbfee267804f621de5c6e61b773783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/d08c2d5e24fbfee267804f621de5c6e61b773783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/654362ba6aad0ab1510a859ae8688a2e14889482","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten