le-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/2239e33d159eba919ac3fbdc3f06f245c56bb2a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-21T17:57:41Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T17:57:41Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"refactor: 專案清理並新增架構 POC 報告\n\n根據新的 `uv` + `Supervisor` 架構方向，對專案進行了大規模的清理和準備工作。\n\n主要變更包括：\n\n1.  **新增架構報告**:\n    *   在 `DOC/` 目錄下新增了 `ARCHITECTURE_POC_REPORT.md`，詳細記錄了 `uv` + `Supervisor` 架構的可行性驗證 POC 的過程、遇到的問題和最終的成功結論。\n\n2.  **大規模清理**:\n    *   **刪除過時的啟動器**: 移除了根目錄下所有獨立的 `run_*.py` worker 腳本。\n    *   **移除多餘的依賴檔案**: 刪除了所有根目錄下的 `requirements*.txt`, `pyproject.toml`, `package.json` 等，因為依賴將由 `uv` 在腳本內部管理。\n    *   **精簡測試與設定**: 刪除了整個 `e2e_tests/` 和 `config/` 目錄，以降低重構期間的複雜性。\n    *   在 `CHANGELOG.md` 中新增了被刪除檔案的完整列表。\n\n這次提交為後續的正式架構重構提供了一個乾淨、專注的程式碼基礎。","tree":{"sha":"5b76c24f112cf0bf388ab5073ceed8285b686ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/5b76c24f112cf0bf388ab5073ceed8285b686ea1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/2239e33d159eba919ac3fbdc3f06f245c56bb2a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url