}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/a2f75ebf4fa494366956ed9e2680d80cd63398ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-21T15:56:22Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T15:56:22Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(test): 新增端對端工作流程測試的初步框架\n\n根據計畫，開始建立一個完整的端對端測試 (`test_full_workflow.py`) 來驗證核心上傳流程。\n\n目前的測試在驗證模型就緒狀態時失敗，這揭示了測試環境中存在底層的狀態管理不穩定問題。\n\n此提交保存了當前的測試進度，以便我們接下來可以專注於重構和解決造成不穩定的根本原因。\n\n同時包含了先前為 `api_server.py` 加入的 WebSocket 除錯日誌。","tree":{"sha":"8a0e1f641d10236e036211eafac5ec5cf2c0b061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/8a0e1f641d10236e036211eafac5ec5cf2c0b061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/a2f75ebf4fa494366956ed9e2680d80cd63398ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signat