/api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/e2c6f25b711b23b4e94f1a0cacc5431936048aa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-21T01:38:02Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T01:38:02Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"[測試] 新增儀表板功能的端對端測試\n\n- **新增儀表板功能 E2E 測試**: 建立了一個新的 Playwright 測試檔案 `e2e_tests/test_dashboard_functionality.py`。\n  - 此測試透過模擬 API 回應和 WebSocket 訊息，完整驗證了儀表板在接收到後端事件時，其狀態（如：系統負載、工作者狀態）能夠正確且即時地更新。\n  - 這確保了使用者回報的儀表板無反應問題可以被穩定地監控與驗證。\n\n- **增強 E2E 測試的穩定性**:\n  - **修正競爭條件**: 移除了新測試中多個因後端回應過快而導致不穩定的初始狀態斷言。\n  - **修正既有測試的崩潰問題**: 修復了 `e2e_tests/test_end_to_end_workflow.py` 中一個因無法處理非預期 WebSocket 訊息格式而導致的 `AttributeError` 崩潰。\n  - **修正測試互動**: 為了讓 Playwright 能夠與 Vue 應用程式互動，在 `vue-app/src/main.js` 中將 Vue app 實例暴露給 `window` 物件。","tree":{"sha":"c954a65deacec510876bdbfeff20168119118826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/c954a65deacec510876bdbfeff20168119118826"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/e2c6f25b711b23b4e94f1a0cacc5431936048aa1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/e2c6f25b711b23b4e94f1a0cacc5431936048aa1","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGUyYzZmMjViNzExYjIzYjRlOTRmMWEwY2FjYzU0MzE5MzYwNDhhYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/f2afac5505f65da9b94c953bd3ca431bb502b6e1","sha":"f2afac5505f65da9b94c953bd3ca431bb502b6e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/f2afac5505f65da9b94c953bd3ca431bb502b6e1"}],"sha":"e2c6f25b711b23b4e94f1a0cacc5431936048aa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/e2c6f25b711b23b4e94f1a0cacc5431936048aa1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/f2afac5505f65da9b94c953bd3ca431bb502b6e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-21T01:09:42Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T01:09:42Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"修復：增強資料庫管理器以防止因無效 JSON 導致的崩潰\n\n在 `src/db/manager.py` 的請求處理迴圈中，為 `json.loads()` 呼叫增加了一個 `try...except` 區塊。\n\n先前，如果 `db_manager` 收到一個格式不正確的 JSON 字串（例如，包含未轉義的引號），`json.loads()` 會拋出一個 `JSONDecodeError`，這會導致處理該客戶端連線的執行緒崩潰並關閉連線。這會引發連鎖反應，使依賴資料庫的服務失敗。\n\n此變更透過以下方式解決了這個問題：\n- 捕捉 `json.JSONDecodeError`。\n- 記錄下格式錯誤的請求資料以供除錯。\n- 向客戶端回傳一個明確的錯誤訊息。\n- 使用 `continue` 繼續處理迴圈中的下一個請求，而不是終止連線。\n\n這使得資料庫服務在面對格式錯誤的資料時更具強健性，避免了服務中斷。","tree":{"sha":"5009814f59a0b8cad15207dad5e31b9583c0b5bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/5009814f59a0b8cad15207dad5e31b9583c0b5bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/f2afac5505f65da9b94c953bd3ca431bb502b6e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/f2afac5505f65da9b94c953bd3ca431bb502b6e1","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGYyYWZhYzU1MDVmNjVkYTliOTRjOTUzYmQzY2E0MzFiYjUwMmI2ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c651ae3d1bfc5df7ab445b4a976bf6ef08f6c79f","sha":"c651ae3d1bfc5df7ab445b4a976bf6ef08f6c79f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c651ae3d1bfc5df7ab445b4a976bf6ef08f6c79f"}],"sha":"f2afac5505f65da9b94c953bd3ca431bb502b6e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/f2afac5505f65da9b94c953bd3ca431bb502b6e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/c651ae3d1bfc5df7ab445b4a976bf6ef08f6c79f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-21T00:47:04Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T00:47:04Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(worker): 修正 main_worker 的日誌導入錯誤\n\n解決了 `main_worker.py` 因嘗試導入一個不存在的日誌設定函式 (`setup_logging_for_module`) 而導致的 `ImportError`。\n\n此錯誤會造成 worker 程序在啟動時立即崩潰，進而觸發協調器（Orchestrator）的健康檢查機制，關閉整個應用程式，是造成 Colabpro 啟動失敗的直接原因。\n\n本次修復移除了對該已棄用函式的導入和呼叫。由於日誌系統已被重構為由父程序（Orchestrator）統一設定，子程序無需再自行設定，只需獲取 logger 實例即可。","tree":{"sha":"696c37dfaeb906470cf052075ff95d02444dec73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/696c37dfaeb906470cf052075ff95d02444dec73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/c651ae3d1bfc5df7ab445b4a976bf6ef08f6c79f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/c651ae3d1bfc5df7ab445b4a976bf6ef08f6c79f","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKGM2NTFhZTNkMWJmYzVkZjdhYjQ0NWI0YTk3NmJmNmVmMDhmNmM3OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/4a9dc80e66f82ebe1f841f00a68949e7f17cdfa9","sha":"4a9dc80e66f82ebe1f841f00a689