github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T00:30:15Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix(orchestrator): 增加 SIGTERM 處理器以防止意外終止\n\n在 `orchestrator.py` 中註冊了一個自定義的 SIGTERM 信號處理器。\n\n這個處理器會捕獲來自外部（例如 Colab 運行環境）的 SIGTERM 信號，記錄一條警告訊息，但會阻止程序因此而退出。\n\n這解決了在 Colab 中，後端服務在啟動後會被無聲終止的問題，確保了服務的持續性和穩定性。","tree":{"sha":"8edfe9f8a80fb13c0a33b3b53a40f7051d461646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/8edfe9f8a80fb13c0a33b3b53a40f7051d461646"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/825f363b692039fe3a22f22412b09e7e1ad15ee2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/