nt_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-20T17:40:45Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(tests): 重構 E2E 測試環境以優化資源使用\n\n本次提交徹底重構了 `e2e_tests/conftest.py`，以解決先前測試環境資源利用率低和隔離性不足的問題。\n\n主要變更如下：\n- **模組級隔離**: 將核心的 `live_server` fixture 的範圍從 `session` 更改為 `module`。這確保了每個測試檔案都在一個全新的、獨立的伺服器環境中運行，並在結束後自動清理，實現了「一個工作者測完就刪掉虛擬環境」的目標。\n- **高效前端建置**: 將耗時的前端建置流程抽離到一個獨立的、`session` 範圍的 `build_frontend_session` fixture 中。這確保了前端資源在整個測試會話中只會被建置一次，大幅提高了測試的整體執行效率。\n- **資料庫自動清理**: 在每個模組的測試開始前，會自動刪除舊的資料庫檔案並重新初始化，確保了測試資料的純淨性。\n- **依賴修正**: 補全了 `requirements-server.txt` 中遺失的 `httpx` 和 `pydantic-settings` 套件。\n- **日誌更新**: 根據 `AGENTS.md` 的要求，更新了 `CHANGELOG.md` 以記錄本次變更。","tree":{"sha":"167271bf4a32e77667ef13c930a49544846c509d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/167271bf4a32e77667ef13c930a49544846c509d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/f0b232b3de3a23cfaa5c7fa700acc7690402a1bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api