879d3f7c13ce27cf3ff9fa76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-20T14:34:41Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-20T14:34:41Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(日誌與模型): 新增日誌檢視器並改善模型選擇介面\n\n本次提交接續前次的工作，實作了新的功能並改善了既有介面的使用者體驗。\n\n主要變更如下：\n\n1.  **新增系統日誌檢視器**：\n    *   建立了一個全新的 `LogViewer.vue` 元件，並將其作為一個獨立的分頁整合至主介面。\n    *   使用者現在可以點擊「系統日誌」分頁，查看由後端傳來的操作日誌，並可手動刷新。\n    *   在 `tasks.js` store 中新增了對應的狀態管理邏輯。\n\n2.  **改善 Gemini 模型選擇體驗**：\n    *   在 `YouTubeReporter.vue` 中，當 API 金鑰無效或無法載入模型列表時，會顯示更清晰、更友善的錯誤提示。\n    *   為「分析影片」按鈕增加了動態的工具提示（tooltip），在按鈕被禁用時，會告知使用者需要先提供有效的 API 金鑰。\n\n3.  **釐清本地轉錄模型工作流程**：\n    *   在 `TaskUploader.vue` 的模型選擇器下方，新增了一則提示文字，明確告知使用者「所需模型若本機不存在，將在開始處理時自動下載」，避免了對「缺少下載按鈕」的誤解。\n\n這些變更提升了系統的透明度與易用性，並已通過端對端測試驗證。","tree":{"sha":"4360c32be19f3bf2f607c115b09fe8f50bc72b8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/4360c32be19f3bf2f607c115b09fe8f50bc72b8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/28d9af4bbd6b7a76879d3f7c13ce27cf3ff9fa76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/28d9af4bbd6b7a76879d3f7c13ce27cf3ff9fa76","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDI4ZDlhZjRiYmQ2YjdhNzY4NzlkM2Y3YzEzY2UyN2NmM2ZmOWZhNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/26393c7973a8f98500b69db0aeec44f4db55107e","sha":"26393c7973a8f98500b69db0aeec44f4db55107e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/26393c7973a8f98500b69db0aeec44f4db55107e"}],"sha":"28d9af4bbd6b7a76879d3f7c13ce27cf3ff9fa76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/28d9af4bbd6b7a76879d3f7c13ce27cf3ff9fa76"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/26393c7973a8f98500b69db0aeec44f4db55107e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-20T13:16:58Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-20T13:16:58Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix: 全面修復 Colab 啟動器並增強穩定性\n\n本次提交旨在徹底解決在 Colab 環境中遇到的一系列啟動失敗、超時和 UI 顯示問題。\n\n核心架構修復 (`Colabpro.py`):\n- **恢復背景執行緒**: 恢復了 `BackgroundRunner` 設計，將後端服務的啟動移至獨立執行緒。這解決了主執行緒被阻塞的問題，從而修正了獲取代理連結時的超時錯誤。\n- **修正 UI 競爭條件**: 移除了 `finally` 區塊中多餘的 `clear_output` 指令，解決了在程式結束時，代理連結等最終狀態可能被意外清除的問題。\n- **修正 `TypeError`**: 修正了 `_eval_js_in_thread` 函式中因錯誤使用雙層大括號 `{{...}}` 而導致的致命語法錯誤。\n\n診斷與 UI 增強 (`Colabpro.py`):\n- **新增 `clear_output` 開關**: 允許使用者自由控制是否在儀表板更新時清理畫面，方便在需要時保留完整日誌進行除錯。\n- **心跳探測**: 新增前置的 `eval_js` 呼叫，用於探測 Colab 前後端通訊管道的健康狀況。\n- **詳細錯誤記錄**: 為代理連結獲取迴圈加入了完整的 `traceback` 日誌記錄。\n\n後端修復 (`src/core/orchestrator.py`):\n- **絕對路徑啟動**: 將啟動子程序的指令改為絕對路徑，解決了「找不到檔案」的根本錯誤。\n- **日誌邏輯修正**: 修正了日誌讀取執行緒啟動過晚的問題，確保能捕獲到完整的子程序日誌。\n\n文件與其他:\n- 新增 `plan.md` 研究報告。\n- 更新 `CHANGELOG.md` 以反映所有變更。\n- 修正了 `Colabpro.py` 中的複製按鈕錯誤。","tree":{"sha":"545ea6538251f3ca5afe1be1a0fc4139aebfcbc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/545ea6538251f3ca5afe1be1a0fc4139aebfcbc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/26393c7973a8f98500b69db0aeec44f4db55107e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-lab