":"2025-08-19T23:14:40Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"根據專案架構文件，此提交覆寫了原有的 `test.py`，並實作了一個全新的整合測試腳本，專門用於驗證所有 `run_*_worker.py` 工作者的獨立運作能力。\n\n這個新的 `test.py` 腳本會：\n- 自動偵測所有 `run_*_worker.py` 檔案。\n- 為每個工作者啟動獨立的測試程序。\n- 驗證工作者是否能在 90 秒內成功建立虛擬環境、安裝依賴並回報準備就緒狀態。\n- 無論成功或失敗，都會強制清理該次測試所產生的虛擬環境，確保測試環境的純淨。\n- 提供清晰的繁體中文輸出與最終的測試總結報告。\n\n此變更取代了先前用於測試前端啟動時間的 `test.py`，使其功能與架構文件中定義的「階段四：自動化整合測試與健康檢查」保持一致。","tree":{"sha":"d15dd47eac41d8314ab89bda4ab9a63572153097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/d15dd47eac41d8314ab89bda4ab9a63572153097"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/536379ea73b45becd83c46bb816d231c61f287cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/536379ea73b45becd83c46bb816d231c61f287cb","node_id":"C_kwDOPeuR7doAKDUzNjM3OWVhNzNiNDViZWNkODNjNDZiYjgxNmQyMzFjNjFmMjg3Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commit/0d7b3dd23cac3701a5ee50e877465287d16de494","sha":"0d7b3dd23cac3701a5ee50e877465287d16de494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/0d7b3dd23cac3701a5ee50e877465287d16de494"}],"sha":"536379ea73b45becd83c46bb816d231c61f287cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/536379ea73b45becd83c46bb816d231c61f287cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/commits/0d7b3dd23cac3701a5ee50e877465287d16de494/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-19T15:02:35Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-19T15:02:35Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"docs: 將架構決策文件化並重組文件\n\n本次提交專注於文件管理與架構決策的記錄，主要包含以下變更：\n\n1.  **更新核心架構文件**:\n    -   在 `DOC/ARCHITECTURE_RESEARCH.md` 中，新增了採用 `Huey` + `SQLite` + `Circus` 作為新技術棧的最終決策、方案比較及系統設計圖。\n\n2.  **重組文件結構**:\n    -   將根目錄下的多個 `.md` 檔案 (plan.md, research*.md) 統一移至 `DOC/` 目錄下。\n    -   過時的研究文件已被加上封存標頭，並移入 `DOC/archive/`。\n\n3.  **新增文件索引**:\n    -   建立了 `DOC/README.md`，為文件目錄提供清晰的導航和說明。\n\n4.  **同步開發計畫**:\n    -   更新了 `DOC/plan.md` 以反映最新的架構方向。\n\n所有變更均依照與使用者的討論進行，並以繁體中文撰寫。","tree":{"sha":"9c08b3b84e3e31b94d4baedc16d54898d7fd3488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/trees/9c08b3b84e3e31b94d4baedc16d54898d7fd3488"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hsp1234-web/wolf_0816/git/commits/0d7b3dd23cac3701a5ee50e877465287d16de494","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starr